<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- NGONI BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">Ukumbuso wa malagizu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ukumbuso wa Malagizu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ukumb</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ukumb</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ukumbuso wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malagizu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha ukumbuso wa malagizu ndi mawuyilu ga malagizu gegidandauliwa mugati ya muvitabu vingi vya malagizu gala muvitabu muhanu vya kutumbula vya Lilaganu la Kadeni. Lihina la Chiebulania la chitabu chenichi mana yaki “Malovi.” Yisadikika kuvya Musa ndi mwayandika wa chitabu ichi nambu nga pandu pahupi pamwishu pidandaula lifwa laki. Chitabu ichi chitumbula kwa malovi aga, “Aga ndi malovi ga Musa geavajovili Vaisilaeli.” Liholo kuvya Musa ndi mwayandika wa Chitabu ichi yilangiswa kuvya ndi chakaka pamahele mu Lilaganu la Hinu. Luhumu lumonga lupatikana muchitabu cha Matendu ga vamitumi musula ya 3:22-23 Petili iyandika kavili malovi gegavi muchitabu cha Ukumbuso wa Malagizu musula ya 18:15-18 na kuyandika kwa kujova kuvya aga ndi malovi ga Musa. Yihotoleka kuvya Musa ndi muyandika wa chitabu cha Ukumbuso wa Malagizu, pamonga na chitabu cha Kutumbula na Kuwuka na Valawi na Mvalangu, pagati ya miyaka 1400 amala 1300 kwakona kuvelekewa Yesu Kilisitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha ukumbuso wa Malagizu chayandikwi ngati malaganu pagati ya nkosi na unkosi wungi weakuutalalila, ngati chayakitiki lukumbi lwa kadeni. Ndi malaganu pagati ya Chapanga na Vaisilaeli. Chapanga ayidakili kuvamotisa vandu ngati ngaviyidakila na kulanda malagizu gaki. Kuvya Vaisilaeli ngavabelili malagizu ga Chapanga, ndi ngavabunili. Lenili ndi lijambu livaha lelilongalewa pandu pamahele muchitabu ichi, nambu neju musula ya 27 na musula ya 28 zilongalela neju na uchakaka uwu yilangisa mota na likoto zila zezipatikana ndava ya kuyidakila amala kubela kuyidakila kwa Vaisilaeli. Makabila ndalindali ga Isilaeli gayimili pavitumbi vivili yeyilolana, vangi viwusa mota na vangi viwusa na likoto ngati njila ya kulimanyisa kuvya vayidakili liaganu lenilo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavili</para>
  <para style="io">Musa ikumbusa gegavahumalili Vaisilaeli lukumbi pavagendayi lugangatu, musula ya 1 mbaka ya 3.</para>
  <para style="io">Udandawula mambu gegajovewayi mulilaganu pagati ya Chapanga na vandu vaki musula ya 4 mbaka ya 26.</para>
  <para style="io">Vandu va Isilaeli vapokili mota na likoto kwa lwami luvaha kulangisa kuvya kuhumila lukumbi ulo lilaganu lihenga lihengu, musula ya 27 mbaka ya 30.</para>
  <para style="io">Musa ilongela malovi ga kumalakisila kwa Joshua na kwa kila likabila la Isilaeli kwakona lifwa laki, pamwishu musula ya 31 mbaka ya 34.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s1">Malagizu kuchitumbi cha Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Chitabu chenichi chivi na malovi gala Musa geavajovili vandu voha va ku Isilaeli lukumbi pevavili kulugangatu kwelihumila lilanga mwa mfuleni Yoludani. Vavili mulikemba la Yoludani papipi na sufu, pagati ya muji wa Palani upandi umonga wa muji wa Tofeli na Labani na Hazeloti na Dizahabu, upandi wungi. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Ndi lugendu lwa magono kumi na monga kuhuma ku chitumbi cha Holebu amala weukemiwa Sinai mbaka Kadeshi Balinea kwa njila yeyihamba chitumbi cha Seili. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Ligono la kutumbula la mwehi wa kumi na monga, mwaka wa alubaini pevamali kuhuma ku Misili, Musa avajovili bwina kila chindu chaalagizwi na Chapanga avajovela. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Akitili chenicho Bambu Chapanga peamali kumuhotola nkosi Sihoni wa Vaamoli mweatalalila pamuji wa Heshiboni na nkosi Ogu wa Bashani ndi mweatalalila kumuji wa Ashotaloti na Edilei. <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Musa atumbwili kuvadandaulila vandu malagizu ga Chapanga lukumbi pevavili kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani kumulima wa Moabu. Akavajovela.<verse eid="DEU 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />“Petavili kuchitumbi cha Sinai, Bambu Chapanga witu atijovili naha, ‘Mtamili lukumbi lutali pachitumbi ichi, hinu yikoli <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />hinu muwuka na muyendelela na lugendu. Muhamba ku mulima wa Vaamoli weuvii kuchitumbi na pandu pa milima ya papipi ku Alaba, kuhitumbi na makemba, ku upandi wa kusini na kumbwani, ena muhamba mbaka mulima wa Kanaani na mulima wa Lebanoni, mbaka kumfuleni uvaha wa Efulate. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Mulola nivapelili nyenye mulima uwu. Hinu muhamba mukautola mumulima wenuwo wula Bambu Chapanga wealapili kuvapela vagogo vinu Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo na pamonga na viveleku vyavi.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa ihagula Vachilongosi</para>
  <para style="s">(Kuwuka 18:13-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Musa akavajovela vandu, “Petavili takona kuchitumbi cha Sinai, nene navajovili naha, ‘Lihengu la kuvalongosa nyenye ndi livaha neju, nene namwene ndu nihotola lepi. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />Bambu Chapanga winu, avakitili mvya mwavamahele, lelu mvili mwavamahele ngati ndondo za kumahundi. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Bambu Chapanga wa vagogo vinu ndi avakita myonjokesa neju mala elufu kuliku chemuvii hinu na kuvamotisa ngati cheavalagizi! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Nambu nene namwene ndu yati nihotola wuli kugega mizigu ya mang'aiso ginu? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Muhagula vandu vana luhala na umanya na vandu vevitopeswa kuhuma mumakabila ginu muni nivakita vavyai vachilongosi vinu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Nyenye mwaniyangwili naha, ‘Lijambu lewajovili ndi la bwina kwitu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Ndi navatolili vachilongosi vinu vevana luhala na vevavii na umanya avo mwevavahagwili kuhuma mumakabila ginu nikavakita kuvya vachilongosi vinu. Navavikili vangi kuvya vakulu va misambi ya vandu elufu, ya vandu miya na ya vandu hamusini na ya vandu kumi. Nahagwili mewa vilongosi vangi mukila kabila.”<verse eid="DEU 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />“Palukumbi lula navalagizi vahamula vinu, ‘Muyuwanila mihalu ya valongo vinu, muhamula ngati cheyiganikiwa pagati ya Vaisilaeli kwa Vaisilaeli amala Muisilaeli na muyehe mweitama pamonga navu. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Mkoto kumpendelela mundu yoyoha pamuhamula, muvayuwanila changali kupendelela, vavaha na vedebe. Mkoto kumyogopa na mundu yoyoha, muni hukumu yemwiwusa yihuma kwa Chapanga. Matakilu gogoha gakavyai ginonopa neju kwinu ndi mugaletayi kwa nene, ni nene yati nihamula.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Lukumbi lulolo navajovili mambu goha gemganikiwa kuhenga.”<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa akuvatuma vamang'omesi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Mva 13:1-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />“Hinu, ngati Bambu Chapanga witu cheatilagazili, tatumbwili lugendu kuhuma ku chitumbi cha Holebu, tapitili mulugangatu lila livaha leliyogofya lemuliwene, kwa kulanda njila yeyihamba mulima wa vitumbi vya Vaamoli. Petahikili Kadesh Balinea, <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />nene navajovili, ‘Hinu muhikili pamulima wa Vaamoli weuvii kuchitumbi wemwapewili na Bambu Chapanga witu. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Mlola, Bambu Chapanga winu avapeli mulima weuvii palongolo yinu. Hinu, muhamba mukautola ngati Bambu Chapanga wa vagogo vinu cheavajovili. Mkoto kuyogopa mewa mkoto kuvagaya!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />“Ndi mwavoha mwabwelili na mukanijovela, ‘Tivatuma vandu vatilongolela, vakaung'omesa mulima, kangi vawuya kutimanyisa njila yoki na miji yetikuyihambila ndi ya namuna yoki kwenuko.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />“Lijambu lenilo lalolikini kuvya la bwina kwa nene, nikavahagula vandu kumi na vavili, mundu mmonga mmonga kuhuma mu kila likabila. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Vandu venavo vahambili ku mulima wula wa vitumbi, vakahika ku likemba la Eshikoli na kukita umang'omesi. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Pavawuyili vatiletili matunda nunuyu gevayavili kuhuma mulima wenuwo na kutijovela kuvya mulima wenuwo weakutipela Bambu Chapanga witu ndi wabwina.”<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />“Nambu nyenye mwagabelili malagizu ga Bambu Chapanga winu, mwabelili kuhamba mumulima wenuwo. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Mwavembeniki mumandanda ginu mukajova, ‘Bambu Chapanga ativengili ndi mana atiwusili pamulima wa Misili. Vakiti Vaamoli vatikamula muni vatikomakesa. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Ndava kyani tihamba kwenuko kuni tidenyiki mitima kwa wogoyu? Vatijovili kuvya vandu va kwenuko ndi majindu vavaha na vatali kuliku tete, na kuvya miji yavi ndi yivaha na luwumba lwaki luhukii kumahundi. Kangi vajovili kuvya vavaweni majindu va viveleku vya Anaki!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />“Nambu nene navajovili kuvya, ‘Mkoto kuvagaya amala kuvayogopa vandu avo.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />Bambu Chapanga winu mweakuvalongolela, mwene ndi yati itovana navu ndava yinu ngati cheakitili kuni mwilola ku Misili kula, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />mewa kulugangatu kula. Kwenuko mwalolili cheavagegili mulugendu ulo lwoha ngati dadi cheakumgega mwana waki mbaka mwahikili apa. <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Pamonga na goha ago geakitili, nambu nyenye mwamsadiki lepi Bambu Chapanga winu, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />ndi mweavalongolili munjila na kuvalondela pandu pa kupumulila. Kilu avalongolili kwa lihundi lelinonopa lelivi na motu na muhi kwa lihundi, muni kuvalangisa njila.”<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu Chapanga akuvabuna Vaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 14:20-45">Mva 14:20-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />“Bambu Chapanga agayuwini malungamiko ginu, ayomili, akalapa ijova: <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />‘Kawaka hati mmonga winu muchiveleku ichi chihakau mweiyingila mumulima wula wabwina wenalagizi kuvapela vagogo vinu. <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />Kalebu mwana wa Yefune, mwene ndu ndi mweiyingila mulima wenuwo, ni nene yati nikumpela mulima wenuwo weaulivatili uvya waki mwene na vaveleka vaki muni avii msadikika neju kwangu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Bambu Chapanga aniyomili mewa nene ndava yinu akanijovela, ‘Hati veve Musa yati uyingila lepi mumulima wenuwo. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Nambu mtangatila waku Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, yati iyingila mwenumo. Hinu mkangamalisa mtima muni mwene yati akuvalongosa Vaisilaeli vautola mulima uvya wavi.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />“Kangi Bambu Chapanga akatijovela tete tavoha, ‘Venavo vana vinu vemujova kuvya yati vivya mateka va makoko vinu, yaani venavo vevavii vadebe neju ndi vamanyili lepi kudandaula gegavii gabwina na gahakau, venavo ndi yati viyingila kwenuko, na nene yati nikuvapela mulima wenuwo uvya wavi. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Nambu nyenye, mng'anamukai na kuwuya kulugangatu kwa njila yeyihambila ku nyanja ya Shamu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />“Kangi mwaniyangwili, ‘Tete timbudili Bambu Chapanga, nambu hinu yati tihamba kutovana ngati Bambu Chapanga witu cheatilagizi.’ Hinu, kila mmonga winu akajitendekeha kutovana ngondo, muni mwaholalili kuvya ngalivii lijambu la yenywa kuuzangila mulima wenuwo wa vitumbi.”<verse eid="DEU 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />“Nambu Bambu Chapanga akanijovela, ‘Vajovela vandu avo vakoto kuhamba kutovana muni yati nivya lepi pamonga nau, vakoto kuhamba, muni vakahambayi makoko wavi yati vakuvahotola vene.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Hinu nene navajovili chenicho, nambu nyenye mwayuwini lepi. Pahala paki mwabelili kulanda lilagizu la Bambu Chapanga, kwa ndindani yinu mwayingili mumlima wenuwo wa vitumbi. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Penapo, Vaamoli vevatamayi kuchitumbi vakahelela kuvazangila ngati chezikita njuchi vakavavinga mbaka ku Seili na kuvahotola kumuji wa Holima. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Ndi pemwawuyili, na kumvembela Bambu Chapanga, nambu Chapanga, avayuwanili lepi amala kuvalola.”<verse eid="DEU 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miyaka yevatamili kulugangatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />“Hinu vatamili lukumbi lutali ku Kadeshi ndi lukumbi lwenulo lwoha vatamili kwenuko.”<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Kangi, tawuyili, tahambili lugendu mulugangatu kuhambila ku nyanja ya Shamu, ngati Bambu Chapanga chanijovili, talyungili papipi na chitumbi cha Seili kwa lukumbi lutali.<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />“Kangi Bambu Chapanga akanijovela, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />Mlyungilyungili kwa magono gamahele pamulima weuna vitumbi, hinu mung'amuka muhamba kukasikazini. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Vapela vandu malagizu aga: Muvi papipi kupita pagati ya mulima wa Seili weuna vitumbi, mulima wa valongo vinu viveleku vya Esau. Venavo yati vakuvayogopa, nambu mujiyangalila, <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />mkotoka kutovana nawu muni yati nikuvapela lepi pandu popoha pa mulima wavi. Yati nikuvapela lepi hati pandu padebe pakulivatila. Mulima wenuwo wa vitumbi ya Seili nivapelili vavelekwa va Esau uvya wavi. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Mkagana chakulya amala manji kuhuma kwavi mganikiwa kugula.”<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />“Hinu, mukumbuka Bambu Chapanga winu, chavamotisi mukila chindu chemwakitili. Avayangalili pemwalyungalyunga kulugangatu livaha ulu. Avi pamonga na nyenye miyaka iyi yoha alubaini na mwapungukiwi lepi na chindu chochoha.”<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />“Hinu tayendalili na lugendu lwitu, tapitili valongo vitu, chiveleku cha Esau vevitama ku Seili, tayilekili njila yila yeyihamba ku Alaba na miji ya Elati na Esioni Gebeli. Kangi tikang'anamuka kuyilanda njila ya kupitila lugangatu lwa Moabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />Bambu Chapanga akanijovela, ‘Kotoka kuvang'aha amala kutovana nawu vandu va ku Moabu ndi chiveleku cha Lutu, muni nivapelili muji wa Ali. Na nene nikuvapela nyenye pandu popoha pamuji wavi.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />Penapo kadeni pamuji wa Ali vatamali Vaemi vavi ngati majindu vamahele vatali na makakala na ngati Vaanaki. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Vandu venavo vawonikini ngati Vaanaki, vandu ava vamanyikini mewa ngati Valefai, nambu Vamoabu vavakemili Vaemi. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Penapo kadeni Vaholi mewa vatamili kumuji wa Seili nambu vavelekwa va Esau vavavingili na kuvakomakesa, kangi vene vakatama pamulima wenuwo pahala pavi. Ngati Vaisilaeli chevakitili pamulima wula wevapewili na Bambu Chapanga uvya wavi.”<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />“Bambu Chapanga atijovili muwukayi hinu, mkupuka kapela Zeledi, ndi tikakupuka kapela Zeledi. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Tangiya tiwukili Kadeshi Balinea mbaka kukupuka kapela Zeledi miyaka selasini na nane yapitili. Lukumbi lwenulo chiveleku choha cha vandu va ntanga ya kuhamba kungondo chamali kufwa kulandana na Bambu Chapanga chavalapili. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Bambu Chapanga avatovili mbaka peavawusili pagati Vaisilaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />“Hinu, vandu voha vevana ntanga ya kuhamba kungondo pevamali kufwa voha, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />Bambu Chapanga anijovili, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />‘Lelu iyi yati mkupuka mubaka wa mulima wa Moabu weuvi kumuji wa Ali. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Yati mukuuhikila mulima wa Vaamoni va chiveleku cha Lutu. Mkotoka kuvang'aha mewa mkotoka kutovana nawu muni yati nikuvapela lepi pandu popoha pamulima wa Vaamoni uvya winu.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />Mulima wenuwo mewa umanyikana kuvya mulima wa Valefai. Penapo kadeni Valefai vatamayi kwenuko, Vaamoni vavakemili venavo Vazamzumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Vavi vandu vamahele, vana mkakala na vatali ngati Vaanaki. Nambu Bambu Chapanga avakomakisi lukumbi pavahikili Vaamoli ndi avavingili na Vaamoli vakatama pandu pavi. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Bambu Chapanga avakitili ngati chila cheavakitili vachiveleku va Esau, Vaedomu vevatamili pamulima wa Seili. Avakomakisi Vaholi lukumbi Vaedomu pavahikili kwenuko, vakatola mulima wenuo na kutama mbaka lelu. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Penapo kadeni Vaavi vatamili muhijiji ya mumihana ya nyanja Meditelanea mbaka Gaza, Vakafitoli vabwelili kuhuma ku chisiwa cha Kaptoli na kuvakomakesa na kutama penapo pahala pavi.”<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />“Petamali kupita mumulima wa Moabu, Bambu Chapanga akatijovela, ‘Hinu mtumbula lugendu. Mkupuka likemba la Alinoni. Nene nivapelili makakala ga kumuhotola Sihoni, nkosi wa Vaamoli wa Heshiboni na mulima waki. Mumzangila na mtola mulima waki na muutalalila. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Kutumbula lelu yati nitumbula kuvakita vandu voha va mulima vavayogopa na kuvya na wogoyu ndava yinu, yati viyuwana mambu ginu yati vindendema na kuvya ngolongondi.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaisilaeli vakumuhotola nkosi Sihoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Mva 21:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />“Hinu natumili vandu kuhuma kulugangatu lwa Kedemoti vahamba kwa nkosi Sihoni wa ku Heshiboni na ujumbi wa uteke weujova: <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />‘Chondi tileka tipite pa mulima waku. Yati tipita munjila na kuhamba lumonga changali kunga'anamuka kuupandi wa kulyelela amala kumangeya. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Chakulya na manji yati tigula kwaku. Chondi tikuyupa utiyidakila tipita ndu kwa magendelu pa mulima waku, <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />mbaka tikupuka mfuleni Yoludani na kuyingila mulima wula Bambu Chapanga akutipela, ngati chevatiyidakili vachiveleku va Esau vevitama kumulima wa Seili na Vamoabu vevitama pamuji wa Ali chevatiyidakili tipita pamulima yavi.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />“Nambu Sihoni, nkosi wa Heshiboni atiyidakili lepi kupita pa mulima waki. Ndava Bambu Chapanga winu, amkitili avya na mtima wangayidakila na ndindani, muni timutova na kutola mulima waki na kutama mwenumo ngati cheyivili hinu.”<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />“Kangi Bambu Chapanga akanijovela, ‘Lola, nitumbwili kuvakita nyenye mumhotola nkosi Sihoni na mulima waki, hinu mtumbula kumtova na kutola mulima waki uvya winu.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Kangi Sihoni ahumili na vandu vaki voha kutovana na tete pamuji wa Yahasa, <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />namwene Bambu Chapanga witu akamkita akotoka kutihotola, tikamkoma mwene na vana vaki na msambi wa manjolinjoli vaki voha. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Tayitolili miji yaki yoha nakuhialabisa, tikakoma vagosi na vadala na vana, tamlekili lepi mundu yoyoha mumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Tatolili kuvya vitu, mifuya pamonga na vindu vyoha vyetavikolili kumiji. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Kutumbula Aloeli, muji weuvi mumihana ya likemba Alinoni na muji weuvi mugati ya likemba lenilo mbaka Gileadi, kawaka muji wowoha wewahotwili kutovana na tete. Bambu Chapanga atihotwisi kuyitola miji yoha. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Nambu tayihegalili lepi milima ya Vaamoni amala mumihana ya mfuleni Yaboki mewa mumiji ya milima ya vitumbi amala pandu popoha petabesiwi na Bambu Chapanga witu kuvya tikoto kuhamba.”<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s">Vaisilaeli vakumuhotola nkosi Ogu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Mva 21:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />“Kangi tang'anamwiki takwelili kuhamba Bashani. Nkosi Ogu ahumili na vandu vaki voha kutovana na tete papipi na muji wa Edelei. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Nambu Chapanga anijovili, ‘Kotoka kumyogopa, muni yati nikukitili umkamula mwene pamonga na vandu vaki na mulima waki. Ukumkitila ngati chawamkitili Sihoni nkosi wa Vaamoli mwaatamayi ku Heshiboni.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />“Hinu Bambu Chapanga atikili timkamula nkosi Ogu wa Bashani pamonga na vandu vaki, tikavakomakesa voha ndi, asigalili lepi hati mmonga. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Tatolili kuvya yitu miji yaki yoha, kawaka hati muji umonga wetaulekili. Miji yoha yavanyagili yavi sitini, ndi kujova, pamulima woha wa Aligobu wewavi pahi ya utalalila na nkosi Ogu wa Bashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Miji yoha yeniyo yavili na luwumba lutali zezavili na mamilyangu na makomeo. Kwavili mewa kwavi na hijiji yamahele yangatindisiwa luwumba. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Ku miji wenuwo tayongomisi vindu vyoha, tahalabisi na kukoma vagosi na vadala na vana ngati chatakitili ku miji ya nkosi Sihoni wa Heshiboni. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Nambu mifuya yoha na vindu vingi vyoha tatolili na kuvya vitu.”<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />“Lukumbi lwenulo tatolili kuvya witu mulima wa vala vankosi vavili va Vaamoli vevatamayi kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani pagati ya mfuleni Alinoni na chitumbi cha Helimoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />Vasidoni vikemela chitumbi chenicho Silioni, nambu Vaamoli vikemela Senili. <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Tatolili kuvya yitu miji yoha ya pandu paselede muvitumbi na pandu poha pa Gileadi na Bashani mbaka ku Saleki na ku Edelei, miji ya nkosi Ogu yeyivii ku Bashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />Nkosi Ogu mwene ndu ndi mweasigalili pagati ya Valefai. Chitanda chaki chechatenganizwi kwa lyuma, chavili na utali wa mita mcheche na upana wa mita zivili kulandana na hipimu yeyiyovaliki, chitanda chenicho chakona chivi mumiji ya Vaamoli uko ku Laba.”<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila gegatamayi kwelihumila lilanga wa Yoludani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 32:1-42">Mva 32:1-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />“Patamali kuutola mulima wenuwo, tavapelili makabila ga Leubeni na Gadi pandu pepavili kaskazini mwa Aloeli papipi na Alinoni na yapinga ya pandu pa hitumbi ya Gileadi, pamonga na miji yaki. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Kangi navapelili yapinga ya likabila la Manase pandu pepasigalili pa Gileadi pamonga na Bashani yoha yeyatalaliwi na Ogu, yaani pandu poha pa Aligobu. Mulima woha wa Bashani ndi wamanyikini ngati mulima wa Valefai.”<verse eid="DEU 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />“Mundu mmonga wa likabila la Manase lihina laki Yaili, anyagili pandu poha pa mulima wa Aligobu, ndi Bashani mbaka mumibaka ya Geshuli na Maaka. Hijiji yoha ahipelili lihina laki, mbaka lelu yimanyikana ngati hijiji ya Hawoti Yaili.”<verse eid="DEU 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />“Vandu va lukolo lwa Makili va likabila la Manase navapelili mulima wa Gileadi, <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />na vandu va makabila ga Lubeni na Gadi navapelili mulima woha kuhuma Gileadi mbaka mfuleni Alinoni. Mubaka wavi upandi wa kusini wavi pagati ya mfuleni na upandi wa kasikazini wavili mfuleni Yaboki ndi weubakana na mulima wa Vaamoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Mubaka wavi kwa upandi welitipama lilanga wahikili mbaka mfuleni Yoludani kwa upandi wa kaikazini, wayendalili mbaka nyanja Galilaya kwa uapndi wa kusini, weyandalili mbaka nyanja ya mwinyu na upandi welihumila lilanga mubaka wakimwahikili mbaka mivitumbi vya Pisiga.”<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />“Lukumbi lula navapelili malagizu aga, ‘Bambu Chapanga winu avapelili mulima uwu upandi welihumila lilanga wa mfuleni Yoludani uvya winu. Hinu nyenye manjolinjoli pagati ya valongo vinu, mtola vindu vya ngondo mkupuka mfuleni Yoludani kuvatangatila makabila gangi ga Isilaeli kutola milima yavi. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Nambu vadala vinu na vana vinu na mifuya yinu, nimanyili muvi na mifuya yamahele, venavo yati visigalila mumiji yenivapelili. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Muvatangatila valongo vinu Vaisilaeli mbaka peavitola mulima wula Bambu Chapanga akuvapela kwelitipama lilanga la mfuleni Yoludani, na mbaka pala Bambu Chapanga peakuvakita vatama kwenuko kwa uteke, ngati cheavakitili kwinu. Pagenago yati muhotola kuwuya pamulima winu uwu wenivapelili uvya winu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />“Kangi namjovili Yoshua, ‘Veve ulolili kwa mihu gaku mambu goha gala Bambu Chapanga waku geavahengili vankosi vavili, Sihoni na Ogu, hinu, mwene yati akuvahengela mewa vankosi va milima yoha yemwinyaga. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Mkotoka kuvayogopa, muni Bambu Chapanga winu, ndi mweitovana na venavo ndava yinu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa ibelelewa kuyingila ku Kanani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />“Lukumbi lwenulo namyupili neju Bambu najovili, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />‘Ee Bambu Chapanga, nimanyili unilangisi nene namuhengaji waku ukulu waku na uhotola waku. Muni kuvii na chapanga yoki kunani amala pamulima mwaihotola kukita mambu gakulu na gakukangasa ngati geukugakita veve? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Chondi nikuyupa nikupuka mfuleni Yoludani, muni niulole mulima wenuo wabwina kwelitipama lilanga mwa Yoludani, wula mulima wabwina wa hitumbi pamonga na vitumbi ya Lebanoni.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />“Nambu Bambu Chapanga aniyomili ndava yinu, akabela kuniyuwanila. Pahala paki anijovili, ‘Yikolili! Kotoka kujova kangi linenu ili. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Kwela mbaka kunani ya chituvilu cha chitumbi cha Pisiga ulola bwina upandi kwelitipama lilanga na, kasikazini na kusini na kwelihumila lilanga, na kuulola mulima wenuwo, nambu veve yati ukupuka lepi mfuleni Yoludani. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Nambu mulagiza Yoshua, mkangamalisa na umsindimalisa mtima, muni mwene yati mweilongosa vandu ava vakupuka mfuleni mbaka kumwambu, kuutalila mulima weukuulola.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />“Ndi tasigalili balapala palikemba papipi na miji wa Beti Peoli.”<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s">Kuyidakila Malagizu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Musa akayendelela kujova, “Muyidakila na kulanda mihilu na malagizu goha genavawulili, muni mpata kutama na kuunyaga mulima wula Bambu Chapanga wa vagogo vinu akuvapela. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Mkotoka kuyonjokesa chochoha mu mihilu yenivapelili, mkotoka kupunguza chindu, mulanda mihilu yoha ya Bambu Chapanga winu yeavapelili. <verse eid="DEU 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Nyenye mwalolili kwa mihu ginu mambu geakitili Bambu ku Baali Peoli. Bambu winu avakomakise vandu voha pagati yinu vevamfugamili chapanga uyo Baali Peoli. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Nambu nyenye mwemwavii vachakaka kwa Bambu Chapanga winu muvi mumi mbaka lelu.”<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />“Hinu nivawulili goha mihilu na malagizu ngati Bambu Chapanga wangu, chanilagizi nikita, muni mugalanda ku mulima wemuhamba kuutalalila. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Myidakila na kuzihengela lihengu mihilu na malagizu goha, muni mukakita chenicho vandu va milima yingi pevipata kumanya mambu ago, yati vimanya kuvya nyenye muna luahala na yati vijova, ‘Chakaka vandu va mulima uwu vana luhala na utopesa!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />“Kawaka mulima wowoha hati ngati uvii uvaha namuna yoki, ndi michapanga yaki yivi papipi nawu, ngati chaavili papipi na tete Bambu Chapanga witu, petikumuyupa utangatila. <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Kangi kawaka mulima wungi wowoha hati ngati uvi uvaha namuna yoki, weuna mihilu na malagizu gegakumganisa Chapanga, ngati izi zenivawulili lelu. <verse eid="DEU 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />Nambu mujiyangalila na kujiyunga neju muni mkotoka kukosewa mambu gala gemwagaweni kwa mihu ginu mwavene. Gakotoka kuyaga mumitima yinu pemwitama. Muvawula vana vinu na vajukulu vinu, <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />kuvala ligono lila lemwayimili palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga winu, kuchitumbi Sinai kula peanijovili, ‘Vakusanya vandu avo palongolo yangu nivajovela malovi gangu muni vagayuwana muni vajiwula kuniyidakila nene pevitama pamulima muni vahotola na kuvawula vana vavi kukita chenicho.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />“Hinu, mwahegalili na kuyima papipi na chitumbi Sinai ndi lukumbi lwenulo wayaka motu, wewahikili mbaka kunani kuni kudandasiki lihundi na chitita ng'ong'olo <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga pealongili na nyenye kuhuma mumotu wenuo, mwayuwini malovi geajovili nambu mwamuwene lepi, mwayuwini lwami lwaki ndu. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Mwene avakokosili lilaganu laki akavalagiza muyidakila mihilu kumi yeayandiki panani ya vibawu vivili vya maganga. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Lukumbi lwenulo Bambu Chapanga anilagizi nivawula mihilu na malagizu goha gemganikiwa kukita nyenye ku mulima wemwikupuka mfuleno Yoludani kuhamba kuutalalila.”<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubeswa kufugamila vimong'omong'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />“Hinu mujiyangalila, mkotoka kukosewa, kuvya Bambu Chapanga pealongili na nyenye na kuchitumbi cha Sinai pagati ya motu mwamuwene lepi higa. Ndava yeniyo mujiyangalila neju, <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />mkotoka kumbudila Chapanga kwa kuhongola chimong'omong'o chochoha, kwa luhumu loloha lwa chigosi amala chidala, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />wa chinyama chochoha cha pamulima amala videge, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />amala luhumu lwa chiumbi chochoha chechikwava pandima amala somba za mumanji. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Mujiyangalila muni lukumbi pemulola lilanga na mwehi na ndondo na vindu vyoha vyemukuvilola kunani, mkotoka kunogela kuvifugamila na kuvihengela, muni vindu vyenivyo Bambu Chapanga winu aviwumbili ndava ya vandu voha pamulima. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Nambu nyenye ndi mwavandu veavagombwili kuhuma mulima wa Misili pemwavi kumang'aiso gangasindimalika ngati mulitanuli la kunyungulusila lyuma. Avawusili kwenuko muni muvya vandu vaki ngati chamvili lelu. <verse eid="DEU 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />Ndava yinu Bambu Chapanga winu aniyomili, na kulapa yati nikupuka lepi mfuleni Yoludani kuyingila mumulima wula wabwina weakuvapela uvya winu. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Nene yati nifwa pa mulima uwu yati nikupuka lepi mfuleni Yoludani, nambu nyenye muvi papipi kukupuka na kuhamba kuutalila mulima wabwina wula. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Mujiyangalila neju mkotoka kukosewa lilaganu lemwakitili na Bambu Chapanga winu, mkotoka kuhongola chomong'omong'o chochoha kwa kutumila higa wa chindu chochoha chechibesiwi na Bambu na kumuwanangisa, <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />muni Bambu Chapanga winu, mwene ndi motu weutinyisa, mwene ndi Chapanga mwana wihu.”<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />“Pamutama pa mulima wenuwo kwa miyaka yamahele, mkapata vana na vajukulu na kuvya vagogolo, ngati mkatumbula kubuda na kuhongola vimong'omong'o muluhumu lwa chindu chochoha, mukakita uhakau palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga winu na kumyomesa, <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />hinu nene lelu nikuzikemela kunani na mulima zilola gala gegikitika pagati yinu, ngati mukuniyidaila lepi yati mwikomakeswa kanyata pamulima wemuhamba kuutola kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani. Yati mtama lepi kwenuko lukumbi lutali, nambu yati muyongomeswa njwe. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />Bambu Chapanga yati akuvapechenganisa mumilima ndalindali, na vandu vadebe ndu pagati yinu ndi vevisigalila kwenuko kwemwipechenganiwa na Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Kwenuko yati mukuyifugamila michapanga ya mikongo na maganga yeyitengenizwi kwa mawoko ga vandu, na yangahotola kulola, yiyuwana lepi amala kulya na yinuha lepi. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Kangi kuhuma mumlima wenuwo ngati mumlonda Bambu Chapanga winu, ni nyenye yati mkumpata ngati mukamlonda kwa mtima winu woha na mpungu winu woha. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Mang'aiso aga goha pegakuvapata kwenuko mwanakandahi, yati mukumuwuyila Bambu Chapanga na kumyidakila. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Bambu Chapanga winu, ndi Chapanga mweana lipyana, yati akuvaleka lepi amala kuvayongomesa, amala kukosewa lilaganu leakitili na vagogo vinu kwa chilapu.”<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />“Muholalela kuvala mambu ga kadeni, mambu gegahumalili kwakona nyenye mwangavelekewa, kuhumila ligono lila Chapanga pamuwumbili mundu pamulima. Mkotakesa pamulima woha, kuhumila pembe yimonga mbaka yingi. Wu, lijambu la kukangasa la namuna yeniyi lihumalili amala kuyuwanika? <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Wu, vandu vamali kuyuwana lwami lwa Chapanga lulongela kuhuma pagati ya motu, ngati nyenye chemwayuwini na vasigalili mumi? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Wu, avili Chapanga yoyoha yungi mwalingili kuhamba kutola vandu vaki kuhuma mulima wungi, ngati Bambu Chapanga winu, cheakitili kwa kulinga na ulangisu na makangaso kwa ngondo na kwa makakala gaki gakulu, akakita mambu gakuyogopesa yani gala gemwagawene kwa mihu ginu ku Misili kula. <verse eid="DEU 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Nyenye mwahotwiswi kugalola mambu ago, muni mupata kumanya kuvya Bambu Chapanga mwene ndu ndi Chapanga kawaka yungi. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Avakitili muyuwana lwami lwaki kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga muni kuvakita muvya mwavandu mwemuyidakila na pamulima akavakita mulola motu waki ukulu na kuyuwana malovi gaki kuhuma pagati ya motu wenuwo. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Ndava muni avaganili vagogo vinu, vakavahagula nyenye mwemuvi chiveleku chaki na kwa uhotola waki mkulu akavawusa kumulima wa Misili. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />Akavavinga palongolo vandu va milima yingi vala vevavi vakulu na vevana makakala kuliku nyenye, muni avayingisa na kuvapela milima yavi yivya uhali winu ngati chayivili mbaka lelu. <verse eid="DEU 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Hinu mukumbuka lelu na kuvika mumitima yinu, kuvya Bambu ndi Chapanga kunani na pamulima kawaka yungi. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Hinu mukamula muhilu na malagizu gaki zenikuvapela lelu muni mfanikiwa, nyenye pamonga na viveleku vinu, na kutama magono gamahele pa mulima wemupewa na Bambu Chapanga winu uvya winu magono goha gangali mwishu.”<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miji ya kutilalila kwelihumila lilanga mwa Yoludani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />“Ndi Musa akahagula miji yidatu yeyivi upandi kwelihumila lilanga mwa mfuleni Yoludani, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />mwenumo mundu ihotola kutilalila na kutama, ngati akomili mundu angavya likoko waki changagana. Mundu ngati mwenuyo ihotola kutilalila mumuji umonga pagati ya miji yeniyo na kuusangula wumi waki. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Ahagwili muji wa Beseli paselede ya lugangatu ndava ya likabila la Leubeni, na muji wa Lamoti kumulima wa Gileadi ndava ya likabila la Gadi na muji wa Golani kumulima wa Bashani ndava ya likabila la Manase.”<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutumbula kwa kuwusiwa kwa malagizu ga Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />“Lenili ndi lilagizu lila Musa avapelili Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Genago ndi maamula, mihilu na malagizu gala Musa avajovili Vaisilaeli pevahumili ku Misili, <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />pavavili kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani, mulikemba lelavili palongolo ya Beti Peoli, pamulima wewavili wa nkosi Sihoni wa Vaamoli, mwatalalila kuhuma muji wa Heshiboni mwenumo Musa na Vaisilaeli vamuhotwili pavahumili ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Vanyagili mulima waki na mulima wa nkosi Ogu wa Bashani. Venava ndi vankosi vavili va Vaamoli vevatalalila kwelihumila lilanga mwa mfuleni Yoludani. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Mulima wenuo wayenili kuhuma Aloeli pamuhana ya mfuleni Alinoni, mbaka chitumbi cha Silioni yani ndi Helimoni, <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />pamonga na pandu poha pa upandi kwelihumila lilanga mwa mfuleni Yoludani mbaka nyanja ya Mwinyu mwishu wa luhelelu lwa chitumbi cha Pisiga.”<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s">Mihilu kumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">Kuw 20:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Musa avakemili Vaisilaeli pamonga, akavajovela, “Nyenye Vaisilaeli, muyuwanila mihilu na malagizu genikuvapela palongolo yinu lelu. Mujiwula genago na kugahenga kwa uchakaka. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga witu akitili lilaganu na tete pachitumbi cha Sinai. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Akitili lepi lilaganu lenilo na vagogo vitu ndu, nambu akitili na tete tavoha mwetivili mumi lelu iyi. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />Bambu alongili na nyenye mwayuwini hotohoto kuchitumbi pagati ya motu. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Lukumbi lwenulo nene nayimili pagati yinu na Bambu, navakokosili gala geajovili ndava muni nyenye mwayogwipi motu wula na mwakwelili lepi kuchitumbi. Bambu ajovili naha.”<verse eid="DEU 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />“ ‘Nene ndi Bambu Chapanga waku, mwanakuwusili kumulima wa Misili, kwewavili muuvanda.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />“ ‘Kotoka kufugamila michapanga yingi nambu nifugamila nene ndu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />“ ‘Kotoka kujikitila michapanga ya vimong'omong'o vya kuhongola amala luhumu lwa chindu chochoha chechivili kunani, amala chechivili pamulima amala chechivili mumanji pahi ya mulima. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Kotoka kuvigundamila na kufugamila, muni nene ndi Bambu Chapanga waku, nina wihu. Nikuvabuna vana uhakau wa dadi zavi, hati chiveleku cha datu na cha mcheche cha vala vevakunivenga. <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Nambu nikuvalangisa uganu kwa maelufu ya viveleku vevakunigana na kuyidakila mihilu yangu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />“ ‘Kotoka kuliluwula lihina la Bambu Chapanga waku kwa uhakaua, nene Bambu Chapanga yati nileka lepi kumbuna yoyoha mweihengela lihina langu kwa mambu gahakau.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />“Mkamula Ligono la Kupumulila na kuyikita ndava ya Bambu, ngati nene Bambu Chapanga waku, chanikulagizi. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Mumagono sita kita mahengu gaku goha, <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />nambu ligono la saba ndi Ligono la Kupumulima lelivikiwi ndava yangu. Ligono lenilo veve kotoka kukita lihengu loloha, amala mwana waku amala msikana waku amala mvanda waku mgosi amala mdala ng'ombi zaku amala punda waku amala chinyama chochoha amala myehe mwaavili mgati mwaku, muni mvanda waku mgosi amala mdala apumulila mewawa ngati veve. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Kotoka kukosiwa kuvya wavili mvanda kumulima wa Misili, na nene Bambu Chapanga waku, nakuwusili kwenuko kwa makakala na uhotola wangu uvaha, ndi mana nikulagizi kamula Ligono la Kupumulila.”<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />“ ‘Vatopesa dadi na nyina waku, ngati nene Bambu Chapanga waku, chanikulagizi, kita chenicho muni utama magono gamahele na mambu gaku gakuhambila bwina ku mulima wenikupela.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />“ ‘Kotoka kukoma.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />“ ‘Kotoka kukita ukemi.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />“ ‘Kotoka kuyiva.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />“ ‘Kotoka kujova udesi kwa muyaku.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />“ ‘Kotoka kumnogela mdala wa muyaku, amala nyumba yaki amala mgunda waki amala mvanda waki mgosi amala mdala amala ng'ombi zaki amala punda zaki amala chindu chochoha cheavili nachu myaku.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />“Genaga ndi malovi gala Bambu Chapanga, avajovili mngonganu winu woha kwa lwami luvaha kuchitumbi kuhuma mumotu na lihundi livaha lila na chitita. Ndi ayongizi lepi chindu pagenago. Kangi agayandiki panani ya vibawu vivili vya maganga akanipela.”<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa ilongela na vandu pahala pa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">Kuw 20:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />“Lukumbi pamwayuwini lwami kuhuma pagati ya chitita chila, kunani ya chitumbi chila chechayaka motu, vachilongosi voha va makabila ginu na vagogo vinu vanibwelili, <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />vakajova, ‘Yuwanila! Bambu Chapanga witu, atigukubukuli ukulu na uvaha waki, tiyuwini lwami lwaki kuhuma pagati ya motu wula. Lelu iyi timuwene Chapanga ilongela na mundu, namundu akona mumi. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Ndava kyani kujivika muhatali ya lifwa? Motu uvaha wula yati ukutikomakesa? Tivi na uchakaka yati tifwa ngati tiyuwini lwami lwa Bambu Chapanga witu, akalongela kavili. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Wu, mundu yoki mwawahi kumyuwana Chapanga mwavili mumi ilongela kuhuma pagati ya motu ngati chatamuyuwini tete na akasigalila mumi? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Mbanga veve Musa uhamba papipi, ukayuwanila goha gegijova Bambu Chapanga witu, kangi ubwela utijovela mambu ago goha geakujovela. Tete yati tikugayuwanila na kugalanda.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />“Bambu Chapanga, ayuwini malovi ginu ago, akanijovela, ‘Nigayuwini malovi gevakujovili vandu ava, goha gevagajovili ndi gabwina. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Ngavivya na maholo ngati aga na kunitopesa na kulanda mihilu yangu yoha pamahele! Mambu gavi goha ngagahambi bwina, vene na viveleku vyavi magono goha gangali mwishu. <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Hamba kavajovela vawuya mumandanda gavi. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Nambu veve Musa sigalila bahapa na nene, muni nihotola kukujovela mambu goha na malagizu goha na mihilu zeuganikiwa kuvawula vagalanda ku mulima wula wenikuvapela uvya wavi.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />“Nyenye muvya na uchakaka mukakita ngati Bambu Chapanga winu cheavalagizi, mkita kila chindu kwa ubwina neju. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Yati mwilanda gala goha gemwalagizwi na Bambu Chapanga winu, muni mambu ginu gavahambila bwina na mpata kutama magono gamahele pa mulima wemutola kuvya winu.”<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s">Mihilu yikulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />“Aga ndi malagizu na mihilu na mambu gala Bambu Chapanga winu, anilagizi nivawula muni mukagahenga ku mulima wemuhamba kuutola na kuutalila pemwikupuka mfuleni Yoludani. <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />Lukumbi lwoha lwemwivya mumi, mganikiwa kumfugamila Bambu Chapanga winu, na kuyidakila mihilu yoha na malagizu zenikuvapela nyenye na viveleku vinu vyoha muni mupata kutama wumi wa magono gamahele. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Muyuwana nyenye Vaisilaeli, muvya mihu kuzihengela mihilu na malagizu muni mumotisiwa na kuyonjokesa neju pamulima uwo weuna ludaka lwabwina kwa ulimaji na kudimila mifuya.”<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />“Hinu muyuwana nyenye Vaisilaeli, Bambu Chapanga winu ndi Bambu mmonga ndu. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Mumgana Bambu Chapanga winu, kwa mtima winu woha na kwa mpungu winu woha na kwa makakala ginu goha. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Mkotoka kukosiwa mihilu iyi yenikuvapela lelu, <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />na muvawula kwa kukangamala vana vinu. Muvadandaulila pemwivya panyumba amala pemwivya mulugendu amala pemwipumulila amala pemwihenga lihengu. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Mugayandika malovi ago na kugakunga mumawoko na pachiwungi chinu muni zivya ukumbuso. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Mugayandika mufelemu za milyangu yinu na mamilyangu ya miji yinu.”<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahakalilo kwa vandu vangayidakila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />“Lukumbi Bambu Chapanga waku, peakuleta pamulima weavalapalili vadadi vaku, Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo, kukupela veve mulima uvaha na weuna miji yeyinyabili wewangaujenga veve. <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />Nyumba zezimemi vindu vyabwina vyangavikiwa na nyenye, viliva vyangagimwa na nyenye na migunda ya mizabibu na mizeituni yangapandwa na nyenye. Bambu Chapanga, yati akuvapeleka ku mulima wenuwo weuvi na chakulya choha chemwigana, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />mjiyangalila kuvya yati mumkosiwa lepi Bambu Chapanga mwavawusili ku Misili kwemwavili vavanda. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Yati mumtopesa Bambu Chapanga winu na kumhengela mwene ndu na kulapa kwa lihina laki ndu. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Mkotoka kugundamila michapanga yingi, michapanga ya vandu vevavi papipi na nyenye, <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />Bambu Chapanga akotoka kuvya na ligoga ndava yinu, na kuvakomakesa njwee pa mulima, muni Bambu Chapanga winu mweavi pagati yinu, ndi Chapanga mwana wihu.”<verse eid="DEU 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />“Mkotoka kumlinga Bambu Chapanga winu ngati chamwamlingili ku Masa kula. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Mukamula kwa kukangamala uamula na mihilu yaki yoha na malagizu goha geavapelili. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Mkita gala gegakumganisa Bambu, muni mambu ginu gavahambila bwina. Yati muhotola kuutola uvya wavi mulima wabwina wula Bambu Chapanga alagagizi kuvapela vagogo vinu, <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />na kuvya Bambu Chapanga yati akuvavinga makoko vinu ngati chavahaidili.”<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />“Magono gegibwela, vana vinu pevakuvakota ‘Kyani mana ya uamula na mihilu na malagizu, Bambu Chapanga witu, avalagizi kukita?’ <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Nyenye yati mukuvayangula naha, ‘Tete tavili vavanda va Falao, nkosi wa Misili, nambu Bambu atisangwili kwa uhotola waki ukulu. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Tete tamuweni kwa mihu gitu, Bambu ikita ulangisu na chinamtiti na mambu ga kuyogopesa neju kwa Vamisili na Falao pamonga na vandu vaki voha. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Atiwusili ku Misili, akatileta penapa na kutipela mulima uwu, ngati chalapili kwa vagogo vitu. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Hinu Bambu atilagizi kuyidakila mihilu iyi yoha na kumtopesa Bambu Chapanga witu, muni mambu gitu gahamba bwina, na ayendelela kutiyunga magono goha ngati cheyivili lelu. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Ngati tavasidikika kuyidakila kila chindu cheatilagizi Chapanga witu ndi Chapanga yati iganiswa na tete.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s">Mulima weuhaguliwi na Bambu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Kuw 34:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />“Bambu Chapanga winu, yati akuvahikisa kumulima wemuhamba kuutola yati akuvavinga vandu milima yamahele kuhuma mumlima wenuo. Pamuhika yati akuyivinga milima saba palongolo yinu gavaha na gegavi na makakala kuliku nyenye: Vahiti na Vagiligashi na Vaamoli na Vakanaani na Vapelizi na Vahivi na Vayebusi. <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />Mewa Bambu Chapanga peakuvahotosa nyenye kuvakamula, yati mukuvatova na kuvakomakesa njwee, mkotoka kukita lilaganu loloha amala kuvahengela lipyana. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Mkotoka kugegana nawu. Kotoka kumgegesa vasikana vaku vagegewa na vasongolo vavi, amala vasongolo vinu kugega vasikana vavi, <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Mkakita chenicho vene yati vakuvayagisa vana vinu vakotoka kumlanda Bambu Chapanga na kuvakita vafugamila vachapanga vangi, na Bambu yati akuvayomela na kuvakomakesa kanyata. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Nambu muvakitila naha, yati mdenya pandu pa kuwusila teta zavi za maganga na kubomola nguzo zavi. Na mudumula nguzo za Ashela na kuyocha motu vimong'omong'o vyavi vya kuhongola. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Mkita chenicho ndava nyenye mwavandu vaki Bambu Chapanga winu. Muvandu voha pamulima avahagwili nyenye muni muvya vandu vaki mwene.”<verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />“Bambu Chapanga avaganili lepi nyenye na kuvahagula ndava nyenye ndi vamahele neju kuliku vandu vangi, nyenye mwavili vedebedebe kuliku milima yoha. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Nambu Bambu Chapanga akuvagana na ilanda chilapu chaavalapili vagogo vinu, ndi mana avasangwili kwa uhotola waki na kuvawusa kuhuma muuvanda kwa Falao nkosi wa Misili. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Hinu, mmanya kuvya Bambu Chapanga winu, ndi Chapanga msadikika mweikamula lilaganu laki na kuvalagisa uganu viveleku vyamahele vya vala vevakumgana na kukamula mihilu yaki. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Nambu akuvalipisa cheyiganikiwa vala vevakumvenga, mewa yati iyogopa lepi kuvabuna vevakumvenga. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Hinu mugahengela lihengu kwa usadikika malagizu na mihilu yenikuvapela lelu.”<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mota kwa vandu veviyidakila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">Ukumb 28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />“Ngati mukagakamullila cha uchakaka malagizu aga na kugahengela lihengu, Bambu Chapanga winu yati itimilisa lilaganu laki na nyenye na kuvalangisa uganu ngati chavahadili vagogo vinu. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Yati akuvagana na kuvamotisa, na nyenye yati myonjokeseka na kuvya na viveleku vyamahele, yati akuyimotisa migunda yinu muni mpata chakulya, divai na mahuta, yati akuvamotisa kwa kuvapela ng'ombi na mambelele gamahele pamulima wealapili kwa vagogo vinu kuvya yati akuvapela nyenye. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Yati mmotisiwa kuliku vandu vangi voha pamulima. Pagati yinu yati kwivya lepi na mgosi amala mdala mwangaveleka mewa kawaka mifuya yinu yangababa. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />Bambu yati iwusa matamu goha gakuyogofya na yati mwipata lepi utamu wowoha uvaha ngati chamwapatili ku Misili kula, nambu yati akuvapela vamakoko vinu matamu ago. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Muvakomakesa vandu mulima wowoha ndi Bambu Chapanga winu mweakuvakita nyenye muvahotola, mkotoka kuvahengela lipyana. Mkotoka kugundamila michapanga ya muni yeniyo yati yivya lingongeka kwinu.”<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />“Mkotoka kujova mumitima yinu, ‘Vandu ava ndi vamahele kuliku tete, tihotola wuli kuvavinga pamulima?’ <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Mkotoka kuvayogopa, mukumbuka chila Bambu Chapanga winu, cheamkitili nkosi wa ku Misili pamonga na vandu vaki voha. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Mkumbuka matovilu ga kuyogofya gemwagaweni kwa mihu ginu, milangisu na makangaso na makakala gavaha na uhotola ukulu, vyenivyo ndi Bambu Chapanga winu muni kuvawusa ku Misili, chenicho ndi Bambu cheakuvakitila vandu vala vemukuvayogopa. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Neju ya ago Bambu Chapanga winu yati ipeleka matendewu pagati yinu mbaka peakuvayongomesa vala vevatili na kujihiha. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Hinu, mkotoka kuvayogopa muni Bambu Chapanga winu, avi pagati yinu, mwene ndi Chapanga mkulu na wakuyogopesa. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />Bambu Chapanga winu yati akuvavinga vandu va milima yingi mbolimboli lukumbi chemuhamba kulongolo. Yati muhotola lepi kuyongomesa voha mulukumbi lumonga, muni mukakita chenicho hinyama ya mudasi yati hiyonjokesa na kuvayogopesa. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Bambu Chapanga winu yati akuvahotosa nyenye muvakamula vamakoko vinu na kuvakita valyungalyunga mbaka vafwai. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Bambu yati akuvahotosa muvakamula vankosi vavi. Yati mukuvakoma na viyiwulika. Kawaka mundu mwaihotola kuvadivalila, mbaka pemukuvayongomesa voha. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Muyocha pamotu vimong'omong'o vyavi vya kuhongola na michapanga yavi. Mkotoka kunogela madini ya feza zavi amala zahabu zavi, mkotoka kutola na kuvikita vya kwinu, mukakita chenicho yati zivya lingongeka kwinu nyenye yati mwivya yomeso kwa Bambu Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Mkotoka kupeleka chindu chochoha chechimyomesa Bambu Chapanga winu, kunyumba yinu, muni ngati mukakita chenicho yati mpewa likoto ngati chechivii chindu chenicho. Ndi mganikiwa kuchibela na kuchivevesa neju ndava muni ndi chindu chechivi na likoto.”<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s">Yidakila kwa usadikika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />“Mihilu yoha yenikuvapela lelu, mganikiwa kukamula na kuzilanda, muni mpata kuvya mumi na kuyongaseka, mpata kuyingila na kutola mumlima wula Bambu Chapanga winu wealagizi kwa chilapu kwa vagogo vinukuvya akuvapela nenye. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Mukumbuka chila Bambu Chapanga winu, chavalongwisi mulugendu lutali kupitila kulugangatu mulukumbi lwa miyaka alubaini, muni avakita muvya vangolongondi na kuvalinga muni amanya gemuholalela mumitima yinu, na ngati mukamula mihilu yaki amala lepi. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Avangolongwisi, akavaleka na njala nambu mwanakandahi akavapela mana mulya, chakulya mwangachimanya mewa vagogo vinu vachimanyili lepi. Akitili chenicho muni avawula kuvya mundu ivya lepi mumi ndava ya libumunda ndu nambu kwa kila linenu leijova Bambu. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Mulukumbi ulo lwa miyaka alubaini nyula zinu zalalili lepi amala magendelu ginu kuhimba. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Mmanya kuvya Bambu Chapanga winu akuvabuna ngati dadi chakumbuna mwana waki. <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Hinu, mkamula mihilu yaki Bambu Chapanga winu, muni muhotola kukita gala geigana mukita na kumtopesa mwene. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Ndava muni Bambu Chapanga winu akuvaleta mumlima wabwina, mulima weuna vikapela na vinyepa na manji gegihuma kunyasi na muvitumbi, <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />mulima weuna nganu na shayili na zabibu na mitini na mikomamanga na mahuta ga mizeituni na wuchi. <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />Kwenuko yati mwipata chakulya chamahele na yati mwipungukiwa lepi na chindu. Matalahu gaki gavi na madini ga lyuma na muhitumbi yaki muhotola kugima shaba. <verse eid="DEU 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Yati mwilya na kuyukuta, yati mkumsengusa Bambu Chapanga winu ndava ya mulima wabwina wevapelili.”<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahakalilo ga kubela kumkosiwa Bambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />“Mkangamala mkotoka kumkosewa Bambu Chapanga winu, kwa kubela kukamula mashaliti gaki na mihilu yaki na malagizu gaki genivalagizi lelu. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Mkamala kulya na kuyukuta na kujijengela nyumba yabwina na kutama mwenumo, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />na lukumbi ng'ombi na mambelele ginu na zahabu na madini ga feza zinu, na kila chindu chemuvili nachu pechiyonjokeseka, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />hinu mkotoka kumeka na kumkosiwa Bambu Chapanga winu, mwavawusili kuhuma mulima wa Misili pandu pemwavili vavanda. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Mwene ndi mwaavalongwisi mulugangatu lula luvaha na lwakuyogopesa, lweluna mayoka gana chimatila chikali na vipilili, mumlima wangali manji, avahumisili manji kuhuma mulitalahu lelinonopa. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Kangi ndi mweavalisili mana kulugangatu, chakulya chila hati vagogo vinu vachimanyili lepi. Akitili chenicho muni avangolongosa na kuvalinga muni pamwishu apata kuvakitila mambu gabwina. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Hinu, mujiyangalila mkotoka kujijovela: Tipatili vindu vyamahele ndava ya uhotola na makakala gitu tavete. <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Nambu mkumbuka kuvya Bambu Chapanga winu, ndi mweakuvapela uhotola wa kupata vindu vyamahele. Ikita chenicho ndava ya kukangamalisa lilaganu leakitili na vagogo vinu mbaka lelu. <verse eid="DEU 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Ngati mkamkosiwa Bambu Chapanga winu, na kulanda michapanga yingi ndava ya kuyihengela na kuyigundamila, lelu iyi nikuvahakali kwa ukali chakaka yati mkomakeswa. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Ngati mukuluyidakila lepi lwami lwa Bambu Chapanga winu, mwene yati akuvakomakesa ngati vandu va milima chevakomakiswi palongolo yinu.”<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s">Vandu vibela kumuyidakila Bambu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 32:1-35">Kuw 32:1-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />“Muyuwanila nyenye Vaisilaeli! Lelu iyi muvi papipi kukupuka mfuleni Yoludani, kuhamba kuutola uvya winu ndima ya vandu va milima yivaha na yina makakala kuliku nyenye. Miji yavi yivaha na yina luwumba lweluhika kumahundi. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Vandu vene ndi vatali na vana makakala, vene ndi chiveleku cha Vaanaki ngati chamwayuwini na ngati vandu chavijova kuvavala, ‘Yani mweihotola kutovana?’ <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Hinu mmanya kuvya mwakuvalongolela ngati motu weutinyisa mikongo ndi Bambu Chapanga winu. Mwene yati akuvatova na kuvahotola palongolo yinu. Nyenye yati mukuvavinga na kuvakomakesa ngati cheavahaidili Bambu Chapanga.”<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />“Bambu Chapanga winu peimala kuvavinga palongolo yinu mkotoka kujova mumtima mwinu kuvya, ‘Bambu atileti tiutalalila mulima uwu. Ndava tete tavandu vetikumganisa Chapanga,’ Nambu Chapanga avavingili vandu ava palongolo yinu ndava vene ndi vahakau. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Muhotola kuutalalila mulima wavi, lepi ndava ya kuvya nyenye ndi muvi na mitima yabwina amala mwavandu mwemkumganisa Chapanga, nambu Bambu Chapanga winu akuvavinga vandu ava palongolo yinu ndava muni vahakau na igana kutimilisa chilapu cheavalapili vagogo vinu, Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Hinu mumanya kuvya Bambu Chapanga winu, akuvapela mulima uwu wabwina uvya winu, lepi ndava kuvya muganikiwa neju kuutalalila, lepi muni nyenye ndi vandu vana ndindani.”<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />“Ndava muni tangiya ligono lila pemwahumili ku Misili mwakona mukumbela Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Hati kuchitumbi cha Sinai, mwamuyomisi Bambu Chapanga na mwene ayomili neju mbaka akagana kuvakomkesa. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Penakwelili kuchitumbi kupokela vibawu vivili vya maganga vyeviyandikwi lilaganu ndi Bambu leakitili na nyenye, natamili kwenuko magono alubaini kilu na muhi, nalili lepi amala kunywa chochoha. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />Kangi Bambu anipelili vibawu vivili vya maganga vyeviyandikwi kwa lungonjo lwaki, vyayandindikwi mihilu yoha yila Bambu Chapanga, avajovili kuchitumbi kuhuma mumotu ligono la mngonganu. <verse eid="DEU 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Pagapitili magono ago alubaini, muhi na kilu Bambu Chapanga, anipelili vibawu vivili vya maganga vyevyayandikwi lilaganu.”<verse eid="DEU 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />“Hinu Bambu Chapanga, anijovili, ‘Wuka uhuluka pahi ya chitumbi kanyata muni vandu vaku vewavawusili ku Misili vakiti gangaganikiwa. Vayilekili kanyata njila yanavalagizi valanda na vajitengenizili chimong'omong'o kwa lufumbu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />“Mewawa, Bambu Chapanga, anijovili, ‘Nivaweni vandu ava, ndi vandu vana ndindani neju. <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />Nileka nivakomakesa, na kuvawusa vakoto kumanyikana pamulima woha na nene yati nikukita kuvya mulima una makakala na uvaha kuliku vene.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />“Ndi nang'amwiki, nikahuluka kuhuma kuchitumbi, kuni nigegili vibawu vivili vya maganga vyeviyandikwi Lilaganu, na chitumbi chayaka motu. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Nikalolokesa nikawona kuvya mmali kumbudila Bambu Chapanga winu, mwamali kutengeneza chimong'omong'o cha zahabu cha mpapakasi kwa lufumbu, kanyata mwalekili kukita gala gemwalagizwi na Bambu Chapanga, kukita. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Hinu nakamwili vibawu vivili vila nikavitaga pahi, nikavidenya palongolo yinu. <verse eid="DEU 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Kangi nagonili chakukupama palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, ngati pakutumbula kwa magono alubaini kilu na muhi, nalili lepi chakulya amala kunywa manji ndava ya kubuda kwemwakitili uhakau palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga na kumuyomesa. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Nayogwipi ligoga likali la Bambu Chapanga kuvya yati akuvakomakesa, nambu Bambu aniyuwanili kangi lukumbi lwenulo. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Mewawa, Bambu Chapanga, amyomalili neju Aloni, na kugana kumkomakesa, nambu mewa nikamyupila lukumbi lulolo. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Kangi natolili chindu chihakau chila yaani mpapakasi wa zahabu mwatenganizi, nikayocha pamotu na kuchitimbatimba na kuyaga na kuvya lububu nyililili, kangi nikataga mukapela kekihelela pahi ya chitumbi.”<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />“Mewa mwamyomisi Bambu Chapanga winu, kwenuko ku Tabela na Masa na Kiboliti na Hataava. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Lukumbi Bambu pavatumili kuhuma Kadeshi Balinea, akajova, ‘Muhamba mkatola mulima wula uvya winu wenivapelili’ Nambu mwambelili kukita cheavajovili mewa mwamusadiki lepi geavajovili. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Nyenye mwamung'anamukili Bambu kuhumila ligono lenavamanyili.”<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />“Hinu najitagili pahi palongolo ya Bambu chakukupama, magono ago alubaini, kilu na muhi muni Bambu ajovili yati akuvakomakesa. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Namyupili Bambu Chapanga, nikajova, ‘Pepayi Bambu, kotoka kuvakomakesa vandu vaku na vahali vaku, vandu vewavagombwili na kuvawusa kuhuma mulima wa Misili kwa uhotola na makakala gaku gavaha. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Vakumbuka vatumisi vaku, Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo, kotoka kulola ndindani na uhakau na kubuda kwa vandu ava. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Vandu va kula ku Misili kwewatiwusili pangi yati vijova, Bambu Chapanga, avawusili muni avakoma kulugangatu muni wahotwili lepi kuvayingisa mumlima wevahadili kuvya akuvapela na ndava avavengili. <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Muni venava ndi vandu vaku mwene, vandu vewavawusili kuhuma ku Misili kwa makakala na uhotola waku ukulu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s">Musa ipokela kangi mihilu kumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:1-10">Kuw 34:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />“Lukumbi lula Bambu akanijovela, ‘Hongola vibawu vivili vya maganga ngati vila vya kutumbula na lisanduku la mbawu, kangi ubwela kwangu kunani ya chitumbi, <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />na nene yati niyandika malovi gala geugayandiki muvibawu vila vyawadenyili, kangi vika vibawu vyenivyo mulisanduku.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />“Hinu natenganizi lisanduku kwa mkongo wa msonobali na vibawu vivili vya maganga ngati vila vya kutumbula, nikagega mumawoko, nikakwela navyu kuchitumbi. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Ndi Bambu akayandika muvibawu vila malovi galagala ngati gakutumbula. Mihilu kumi geavapelili gealongela kuhuma mumotu ligono lila la mumngonganu. Kangi Bambu akanipela vibawu vila. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Nang'anamwiki na kuhelela kuhuma kuchitumbi, na ngati Bambu Chapanga chanilagizi, navikili vibawu vyenivyo mugati ya lisanduku lenatenganizi, na vivii mugati ya lisanduku lenilo ngati Chapanga chanilagizi.”<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />“Isilaeli vagendili kuhuma viliva vya vandu va Yaakani mbaka Mosela. Penapo Haluni afwili na vakamzika. Na Eleazali mwana waki ndi akavya mteta wa Chapanga pahali paki. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Kuhuma penapo, vagendili mbaka Gudigoda, na kuhika Yoti Batha, pandu pana vipela vyamahele vya manji. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Lukumbi lwenulo Bambu Chapanga ahagwili vandu va likabila la Lawi kugega Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga muni vamuhengela ngati vamteta va Chapanga na kuvamotisa vandu kwa kuhengela lihina laki ngati chevikita lelu. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Ndava yeniyo vandu va likabila la Lawi livii lepi na pandu pakuhala pamulima pagati ya Vaisilaeli vayavi, chevapokili ndi utopesa wa kuvya vamteta va Bambu, ngati Bambu Chapanga winu, cheavajovili.”<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />“Natamili kuchitumbi mumagono alubaini, muhi na kilu, ngati pakutumbula. Bambu Chapanga, aniyuwanili mala yingi kangi na kuyidakila kuvya akuvakomakesa lepi vagogo. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Kangi akanijovela, ‘Wuka uyendelela na lugendu lwaku na kuvalongosa vandu muni vahotola kuyingila na kuutola mulima wenalapili kwa vagogo vinu kuvya nikuvapela.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cheigana Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />“Hinu nyenye Vaisilaeli, Bambu Chapanga winu igana lepi chindu chingi chochoha, nambu kumtopesa ndu Bambu Chapanga winu, kukita gala goha geigana na kumgana na kumhengela kwa mitima winu woha na mpungu winu woha, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />na kuyikamula mihilu na malagizu ga Bambu zenivavikili lelu, muni vikutangatila muwumi waku mwavene. <verse eid="DEU 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Lola kumahundi na kunani neju kwa Chapanga ndi kwaki Bambu Chapanga winu, mulima na vyoha vevivili mugati yaki ndi vyaki. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Nambu Bambu Chapanga, avi na mnogo neju kwa vagogo vinu, akavagana na akavahagula nyenye viveleku vyavi muvya vandu vaki pagati ya vandu vangi voha, ngati chayivili lelu. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Hinu mumyidakila Bambu, mkotoka kuvya na ndindani kangi. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Muni Bambu Chapanga winu, ndi Chapanga wa vachapanga na Bambu wa mabambu. Mwene ndi Chapanga mkulu na mweavi na makakala, na wakuyogopwa, ipendelela lepi amala ipokela lepi swinda. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Mwene akuvakengelela vakiva na valipwela, akuvagana vayehe na kuvapela chakulya na nyula. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Hinu, mvagana vayehe muni na nyenye mewa mwavili mwavayehe ku mlima wa Misili. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Mumtopesa Bambu Chapanga winu, na umgundamila mwene ndu, muvya pamonga nayu kwa uchakaka na kulapa kwa lihina laki. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Mwene ndi mweiganikiwa kulumbiwa, ndi Chapanga winu mweavahengili mambu gavaha na ga kuyogopwa gemwagalolili kwa mihu ginu mwavene. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Lukumbi vagogo vinu pavahambili ku Misili, vavili vandu sabini ndu, nambu hinu Bambu Chapanga winu, avakitili mvyayi mwavamahele ngati ndondo za kunani.”<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Bambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />Musa akavajovela Vaisilaeli, “Mumgana Bambu Chapanga winu, na magono goha myidakila mashaliti na mihilu na malagizu gaki goha. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Nyenye lelu mumanya kuvya, ndava muni nijova lepi hinu na vana vinu, vala vangamanya amala kulola mbunu wa Bambu Chapanga winu, chila cheavili mukulu na mweavi na makakala na uhotola, <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />na milangisu yaki na makangaso gaki geakitili ku Misili kula kwa nkosi Falao na mulima waki woha. <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />Walolili geavahengili manjolinjoli ga Misili, falasi zavi na mutuka za ngondo, cheavagubiki voha kwa manji ga nyanja ya Shamu, mewa mwalolili Chapanga cheavakomakisi njwee msambi wa manjolinjoli venavo mbaka lelu. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Mkumbuka Bambu, chaavakitili kulugangatu kwakona ya kuhika penapa, <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />na mambu geavakitili Datani na Abilamu, vana va Eliabu, mwana wa Lubeni, palongolo ya vandu voha va Vaisilaeli ndima wewagubwiki na kuvamila pamonga na vandu vavi, mandanda gavi hinyama na vatumisi vavi voha. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Kwa mihu ginu galolili matendu goha aga gavaha geahengili Bambu.”<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mota za mulima wa ahadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />“Ndava yeniyo muyidakila mihilu yoha yenivapelili lelu muni muvya na makakala ga kuuyingila mulima wemukupuka mfuleni Yoludani kuhamba kuutola, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />muni mutama magono gamahele weuna ludaka lwabwina kwa kudima na kulima, ndi Chapanga avalapili vagogo vinu kuvya yati akuvapelana vene na viveleku vyavi. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Muni mulima wemuyingila kuyitola yivi lepi ngati mulima wa Misili kwemuhumili, kwe mwamijili mbeyu, mwayitalili manji kwa magendelu ngati mgunda udebe wa makolo, <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />nambu mulima wemuhamba kuuutola pemwimala kupuka mfuleni Yoludani, ndi mulima wa vitumbi na makemba, mulima weupata manji ga fula kuhuma kunani. <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />Bambu Chapanga winu, akuuyunga mulima wenuwo, akuulola magono goha ga kutumbula kwa mwaka mbaka mwishu wa mwaka.”<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />“Hinu mkayidakila kwa usadikika mihilu yangu yenivapelili lelu, mgana Bambu Chapanga winu, mumuhengela kwa mtima winu woha na kwa mpungu winu woha. <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />Ngati mkakita chenicho, hinu mwene yati itonyesa fula pa mulima winu lusenje lwaki, fula za chihuku na fula vuli, na nyenye yati mbena mabenu ginu na divayi yamupya na mahuta ginu. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Yati imelesa mahamba mumigunda ndava ya ng'ombi zinu, na nyenye yati mwilya na kuyukuta. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Mujiyangalila, mitima yinu mkotoka kukongewa na mundu, na kung'amuka na kuyifugamila michapanga yingi na kuyigundamila. <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Ngati mkakitayi chenicho, Bambu yati akuvayomela neju, yati idinda kunani na fula yati yivya lepi, na mulima yati uwusa lepi mabenu gaki, yati mwifwa kanyata kuhuma pamulima wabwina yemupewili na Bambu.”<verse eid="DEU 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />“Mugavika malovi gangu aga mumitima yinu na mumpungu winu. Mugakunga mumawoko ginu ngati ukumbuso. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Muvawula vana vinu malovi aga na kuvadandaulila pemwitama munyumba zinu, pemwigenda na pemwipumulila na pamuyimuka. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Muyandika mumihana ya fulemu za nyumba zinu na mumilyangu yinu, <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />muni nyenye na vana vinu mutama magono gamahele pa mulima wula Bambu Chapanga winu alapili kuvapela vagogo vinu, ngati chegavili magono ga kunani chegavili panani ya mulima.”<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />“Mkakamula bwina mihilu yeniyi yoha yenivapelili: Kumgana Bambu Chapanga winu, kukita goha geigana na kuvya nayu pamonga munjila zaki zoha, <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />ndi Bambu Chapanga, yati akuyivinga milima yoha iyo palongolo yinu, na nyenye yati mutola mulima uvya winu, weuvi na vindu vyamahele vya milima yivaha na yeyivi na makakala kuliku nyenye. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Kila pandu pemulivatila kwa magendelu ginu yati pivya pinu, mulima winu yati uyenela kuhuma kulugagatu, upandi wa kusini, mbaka vitumbi vya Lebanoni upandi wa kasikazini, na kuhuma mfuleni Efulati upandi welihumila lilanga mbaka nyanja ya Meditelania yeyivii upandi walitipama lilanga. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Kawaka mundu yoyoha mweihotola kuvadivalila. Popoha pemwihamba pamulima wenuwo, Bambu Chapanga winu, yati akuvasopa wogohi na yati vakuvayogopa ngati chavahadili.”<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />“Muyuwanila, lelu iyi nikuvapela mambu gavili muhagula, kumotisiwa amala kupewa likoto. <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />Yati umotisiwa ngati myidakila mihilu ya Bambu Chapanga winu zenikuvapela lelu iyi, <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />na yati mupewa likoto, ngati muyidakila lepi mihilu ya Bambu Chapanga winu na kuyileka njila yenavalagizi, mukayifugamila michapanga yingi yamwangayimanya. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Bambu peakuvahikisa pa mulima wemuhamba kutama, yati mkokosa mota kuhuma panani ya chitumbi Gelizimu na likoto kuhuma chitumbi Ebali. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Vitumbi vyeniyi yivili yivi kumwambu ya, upandi kwelitipama lilanga wa mfuleni Yoludani ku mulima wa Vakanani vevitama kulikemba la mfuleni Youdani papipi na muji wa ku Giligali kutali lepi na mialoni. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Yikuvagana kukupuka mfuleni Yoludani muyingila na kuutoala mulima uvya winu wula Bambu Chapanga winu, akuvapela. Lukumbi pemukuyitola kuvya yinu na kutama mwenumo, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />mujiyangali kuvya mukuyidakila mihilu na malagizu yoha yenikuvapela lelu.”<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s">Pandu pene ndu pa kumyupila Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />“Musa akayendelela kujova, aga ndi malagizu na mihilu yemuganikiwa kulanda mumlima yila Bambu Chapanga wa vagogo vinu, avapelili uvya wavi, mulukumbi lwoha lwemutama pamulima. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Muhalabisa njwe pandu poha ndi vandu pevifugamila michapanga yavi muvitumbi hitali na vidunda na pahi ya mikongo yeyina mambanda ga chimuwili. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Mudenyela kutali pandu zavi pa kuwusila teta na mugabomola maganga gavi gevigundamila, muyocha motu nguzo za chapanga mweikeiwa chidala wa Ashela na kudumula vimong'omong'o vyavi vya kuhongola na kugawusila kutali mahina gavi pandu mwenumo.”<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />“Mkotoka kumfugamila Bambu Chapanga winu, ngati chavigundamila vene. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Nambu yati mwihamba pahala ndi Bambu Chapanga winu, peihagula mumakabila goha muni kulivika lihina laki na matamilu gaki penapo, kwenuko ndi kwemwihamba. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Kwenuko yati mwipeleka teta zinu za kutinyisa njwee na zabihu na teta na lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi na teta zingi zoha na teta za chilapu na teta za kuwusa kwa kugana kwinu, na teta ya uvelekwa wa utumbula wa ng'ombi na mambelele ginu. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Kwenuko yati mwilya palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga winu, na yati mwivya na luheku nyenye pamonga na vandu va munyumba yinu vindu vyabwina vyamahele vyemupewili na Bambu Chapanga winu, pemwamali kuhengea lihengu.”<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />“Mkotoka kukita ngati chatikita lelu apa, kila mundu ikita ngati cheigana, <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />muni mwakona mwangayingila pandu pakupumulila na muuhali weakuvapela Bambu Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Nambu yati mukupuka mfuleni Yoludani na kuhamba kutama pamulima wula Bambu Chapanga winu, weakuvapela kuvya yinu, mwene yati akuvapela pumulilo kwa makoko vinu vevakuvatindila voha kwenuko yati mtama bwina, <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />hinu pandu penapo ndi Bambu Chapanga winu, peihagula muni lihina laki litama, penapo ndi pemwipeleka vindu vyoha vyanavalagizi: Luteta lwinu lwa kutinyisa na luteta lungi na lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi na mawusilu ginu na teta za chilapu zemuhadili kumuwusila Bambu. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Kwenuko yati mwiheka palongolo yaki Bambu Chapanga winu, nyenye pamonga na vana vinu vagosi na vadala, vatumisi vinu vagosi na vadala na Valawi vevitama pamiji yinu, muni vene vavi lepi na ndima yavi. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Mujiyangalila mkotoka kuwusa teta za kutinyisa lwinu pahala popoha pemukupawona, <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />nambu pandu peakupahagula Bambu pagati ya limonga ya makabila ginu. Penapo ndi pamuwusa teta zinu za kutinyisa, na ndi pamkitila mambu goha genilagizi.”<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />“Nambu muhotola kuhinja na kulya hinyama yinu pandu popoha pemwitama chemugana, muni ndi mota zempewili na Bambu Chapanga winu. Vandu voha vevanyambasiki na vangayambasika vihotola kulya nyama zenizo, ngati chamwilya nyama ya funo amala swala. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Nambu mkotoka kulya ngasi ya hinyama yeniyo, muyita pahi ngati manji. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Mwiganikiwa lepi kulya pamiji yinu, lilundu limonga pagati ya malundu kumi pagati ya vyakulya vinu amala divayi yamupya na ya mahuta amala uvelekwa winu wa kutumbula wa misambi ya ng'ombi na misambi yinu ya mene na mambelele, amala chochoa chemuvikii chilapu chemwiwusa, amala teta zaku za kuwusa kwa kugana, amala teta zaku maalumu. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Yati mwilya vindu vyenivyo palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga winu, pandu peihagula Bambu Chapanga winu. Yati mwilya nyenye pamonga na vana vinu vagosi na vadala, vatumisi vinu vagosi na vadala na Valawi vevitama pamiji yinu. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Mewa mkangamala, kuvya yati mkuvakosiwa lepi Valawi mulukumbi lyoha lwemwivya pamulima winu.”<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />“Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga winu, peakuupanula mulima winu, ngati cheavahaidili na nyenye yati mwijova, ‘Yati tinogela kulya nyama,’ Ndava mwinogela kulya nyama, penapo mwihotola kulya nyama chila chemwigana. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Hinu pandu peakupahagula Bambu Chapanga winu, avika liina laki avi kutali neju, penapo mwihotola kuhinja ng'ombi amala limbelele loloha lila leavapelili Chapanga, ngati cheavalagazili, na mwihotola kulya nyama chila chemwigana, ngati chemuvii mumiji yinu. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Yati mwilya nyama yeniyo ngati chemwilya huluku amala swala, mundu yoyoha ihotola kulya, mweanyambasiki amala mweanganyasika. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Nambu mkotoka kulya ngasi muni ngasi ndi wumi, hinu mkotoka kulya wumi pamonga na nyama. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Mkotoka kulya ngasi yeniyo, nambu muyiyita pahi ngati manji. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Ngati mwilya lepi ngasi, nyenye pamonga na viveleku vinu, vindu vyoha vyamuhenga yati vivya bwina, muni yati mwivya mukiti lijambu labwina palongolo ya Bambu. <verse eid="DEU 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Vindu vyevibaguliwi ndava ya Bambu yati mwiwusa na teta zinu za chilapu, yati mtola na kupeleka pandu pala Bambu peakupahagula. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Muleta teta ya kutinyiswa panani ya pandu pa kuwusila teta pa Bambu Chapanga winu, vyoha nyama na ngasi. Ngasi yiganikiwa yiyitiwa pamuhana ya pandu pa kuwusila teta za Bambu Chapanga winu, nambu nyama mwiholotola kulya. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Muvya vasadikika kuyidakila malovi aga genivalagizi, muni mambu ginu gahamba bwina pamonga na viveleku vinu magono goha gangali mwishu, muni yati mwikita lijambu la bwina na chakaka palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga winu.”<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahakalilo ndava kugundamila vimong'ong'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />“Bambu Chapanga winu, pehimala kuvayongomesa vandu milima palongolo yinu, nambu pemukuvavinga na kutama pamulima wavi, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />mujiyangalila mkotoka kujiyingiswa mumtegu kwa kugalanda gala gegamali kuyongomeswa palongolo yinu. Mkotoka kukotekesa mambu ga kuyivala michapanga yavi, mkajova, ‘Vandu va milima iyi vayigundamila wuli michapanga yavi? Muni na tete tihotola kugundamila chichocho.’ <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Katu mkotoka kumfugamila Bambu Chapanga winu, kwa njila zavi, ndava mukuyifugamila michapanga yavi, vakitili mambu gamahele ga kuyomesa, vahikili hati kuvawusa kafala vana vavi vagosi na vadala ndava ya kutambikila michapanga yavi.”<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />“Mvya vasadikika kuvya mwikita kila chindu chenivalagizi, mkotoka kuyongesa chindu amala kupunguza chindu.”<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />“Ngati akahumila mlota wa Chapana wa amala mlondola wa ndoto pagati yinu, akavakokosela milangisu na makangaso, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />na ngati ulangisu amala makangaso genago gakahumila, Na mlota wa Chapanga yula akajova, tiyilanda michapanga yingi na kuyihengela, michapanga mwangayimanya, <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />mkotoka kumyuwanila malovi ga mlota wa Chapanga mwenuyo amala mlondola wa ndoto, muni Bambu Chapanga winu, akuvatumila venavo kuvalinga, muni amanya ngati mukumgana mwene Bambu kwa mtima waku woha na mpungu waku woha. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />Mumlanda Bambu na kumtopesa, mlanda mihilu yaki na kuyidakila lwami lwaki mumuhengela na kuvya pamonga nayu. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Nambu mlota wa Chapanga mwenuyo amala mlondola wa ndoto yati ikomewa muni avawulili nyenye mumbela Bambu, mwavawusili mulima wa Misili na kuvagombola kuhuma muuvanda, muni muleka njila yila Bambu Chapanga winu, yeavalagizi muyilanda. Chenicho ndi chemuleka uhakau pagati yinu.”<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />“Yikavya mlongo waku amala mwana waku mgosi amala mdala amala mkozi wa papipi neju amala mdala waku mweukumgana akakukohakesa chimfiyu kwa kujova, ‘Tihamba tikafugamila michapanga yingi,’ Yila wangayimanya veve amala vagogo vaku, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />amala mmonga wa vachapanga ya vandu vevitama papipi na nyenye amala michapanga ya vandu vevitama kutali kuhuma upandi umonga wa mulima mbaka upandi wungi wa mulima, <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />kotoka kumyidakila akukohakesa amala kumuyuwanila amala kumhengela lipyana, amala kotoka kumlekekesa amala kumuhiha, <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />nambu umkoma. Veve yati wivya wa kutumbula mukumkoma na vangi voha vagelekela. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Mumtova na maganga mbaka afwayi, ndava alingili kukuvika patali na Bambu Chapanga waku, mwakuwusili kuuvanda ku misili. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Hinu Vaisilaeli voha yati viyuwana na kuyogopa, na katu yati vikita lepi uhakau ngati wenuo.”<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />“Pemwiyuwana mumiji yemupewili na Bambu Chapanga winu, muni mutama, <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />kuvya vandu nunuyu pagati yinu vahakau, vakuvayagisa vandu va muji vakuvajovela, Tihamba tikafugamila michapanga yingi, mwangayimanya. <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />Hinu mkakita umang'omesi bwina, na ngati chakaka lijambu la kuyomesa likitiki pagati yinu, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />mganikiwa kuvakoma vandu va muji wenuo kwa upanga, yati mukuuyongomesa muji wenuo na kila chindu chechivili pamonga na mifuya yoha kwa upanga. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Mtola vindu vyemnyangili vyoha paluvanja lya muji wenuo na kuyocha motu ngati teta ya kutinyisa kwa Bambu Chapanga winu, muji wenuo yati usigalila kuvya mang'ova magono goha, yati ujengewa lepi kavili. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Mkotoka kutola chindu chochoha chechiwusiwi ndava ya kutinyiswa, muni Bambu aleka ligoga laki livaha, avalangisa lipyana na kuvakita muvya vamahele neju ngati chavahadili vagogo vinu, <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />ngati ndu mkayidakila malovi gaki na kulanda mihilu yaki yoha yenikuvapela lelu, na kukita gegiganisa palongolo yaki Bambu Chapanga winu.”<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s">Mivelu ya malilu yeyibesiwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />“Nyenye ndi vana va Bambu Chapanga winu, mkotoka kujilemba nembu amala kuketa lupanja ndava ya mundu mweafwili. <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Nyenye ndi vandu vaki Bambu Chapanga winu, avahagwili muvya waki pagati ya vandu voha vevitama pamulima.”<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hinyama yeyiganikiwa kuliwa na yangaganikiwa kuliwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">Vala 11:1-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />“Mkotoka kulya chindu chiyidakiliwa lepi munjila ya kumfugamila Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Muhotola kulya hinyama iyi: ng'ombi na mambelele na mene, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />swala na huluku na kongoni na mene za mdasi na swala wamsopi na pofu na chipalama, <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />na kila chimanya chechina kwatu zezilekengine pandi zivili na chechilukula, chenicho muhotola kulya. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Nambu mkotoka kulya chinyama chochoha chechina kwatu zezilekengine lepi pandi zivili na chechilukula, mkotoka kulya ngamiya na chipecha na pelele, pamonga chilukula nambu kwatu zaki zilekengine lepi pandi zivili, vinyama vyenivyo vidakiliwa lepi munjila ya kumfugamila Chapanga <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Mewa mkotoka kulya liguluvi, pamonga kwatu zilekengine pandi zivili nambu lilukula lepi, lenilo liyidakiliwa lepi munjila ya kumfugamila Chapanga, mkotoka kulya nyama zavi amala kupamisa mituhi yaki.”<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />“Muhotola kulya kila aina ya somba zezina mapezi na magamba. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Nambu chiumbi chochoha chechitama mumanji changali mapezi na magamba mkotoka kulya, vyenivyo yidakiliwa lepi munjila ya kumfugamila Chapanga.”<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />“Muhotola kulya videge vyoha vyeviyidakiliwi na Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Nambu mkotoka kulya videge ivi: Tai na kapungu na tumbusi, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />kengewa mdung'u na kengewa mtitu na mambanga ga namuna yoyoha, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />na aina zoha za makungulu, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />na mbuni na chihumba njila na lilova somba na mambanga kwa namuna zaki, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />na matuhi na mumbi na lituhi livaha, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />na mpeta na ngong'ondo na livata manji, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />na kolongo na ndiwu na hudihudi na chinimanima.”<verse eid="DEU 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />“Mewa mkotoka kulya vingokoko vyoha vyevina vevikwava vyevina magwaba viyidakiliwa lepi munjila ya kumfugamila Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Muhotola kulya viumbi vyoha vyevina magwaba vyeviyidakiliwa kuliwa.”<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />“Mkotoka kulya nyama ya chinyama chechifwili. Muhotola kumpela muyehe mweitama mumiji yinu alyai amala muhotola kumgulisila mundu wa mulima wungi, muni nyenye mwavamsopi na Bambu ndi Chapanga winu, na mkotoka kumvilisa mwana mene mumavele ga nyina waki.”<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizu kuvala lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />“Muwusa lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi ya mabenu ginu goha ga kumgunda kila mwaka. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Kangi muhamba pandu pala Bambu Chapanga winu pahangwili mkamgundamila na pamwivya palongolo yaki yati mwilya lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi za mabenu na divayi yinu na mahuta na chiveleku va kutumbula va ng'ombi na mambelele ginu, mkita naha ndava ya kumtopesa Bambu Chapanga winu, magono goha. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Nambu ngati pandu pala ndi patali neju na nyenye muhotola lepi kugega lilundu limonga pagati kumi ga mabenu ginu gemumotisiwi na Bambu Chapanga winu, ndi mkita chenichi, <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />Mugulisa mabenu ginu na mtola mshonga ginu mbaka pandu peapahagwili na kumfugamila Bambu Chapanga winu, <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />mtumila mashonga genago kwa kugula chochoha chemwigana, nyama ya ng'ombi na ya limbelele na divayi amala mnyweso weugalisa, yati mwilya na kuhekelela palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga winu, pamonga na valongo vinu.”<verse eid="DEU 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />“Mkotoka kuvakosiwa Valawi vevitama pagati yinu, vene vavi lepi na lilundu amala ndima yavi vene. <verse eid="DEU 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Na kila mwishu wa mwaka wa datu muwusa lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi ya mabenu ginu goha na kuvika muchibana mumiji yinu. <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />Vyenivyo yati vivya ndava ya Valawi ndava muni vavilepi na ndima yavi vene yevihala pagati yinu, na vayehe na vakiva na valipwela vevitama mumuji winu yati vibwela kulya na kuyukuta. Mkita naha na Bambu Chapanga winu, yati avamotisa mumahengu ginu goha gemkita kwa mawoko ginu.”<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s">Mwaka wa Saba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Vala 25:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />“Kila mwishu wa mwaka wa saba yati mukuvalekekesa vemukuvadayi voha. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Chenichi ndi chemwikita: Kila mmonga mwamkopisi mlongo waki, ndi aleka kumdayi muni Bambu mwene ahamwili kuvya lideni lilekekeswa. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Muhotola kumdayi myehe nambu uganikiwa kumlekekesa Muisilaeli muyaku mweukumdayi.”<verse eid="DEU 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />“Bambu Chapanga winu, yati akuvamotisa neju, pamulima weavapelili uvya winu. Kawaka hati mmonga mwaivya mngangu pagati yinu, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />ngati mukumyidakila Bambu Chapanga winu, kwa kulanda mihilu kwa usadikika zenikuvapela lelu iyi. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Bambu Chapanga winu, avamotisa ngati chavahadili. Na nyenye yati mukuyikopesa milima yamahele, nambu nyenye yati mwikopa lepi. Mewawa yati mtalalila milima yamahele nambu milima yeniyo yati yikuvatalila lepi nyenye.”<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />“Kukavyayi na mngangu pagati ya valongo vinu mumiji ya milima yemupewa na Bambu Chapanga mkotoka kuvya vanotani na mtima weunonopa kwaki. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Nambu muvya na mtima wabwina wa kuwusa na kumkopesa kwa kugana, chindu chochoa vangayvya nachu chechikuvakola kwa maganu gaki. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Mujiyangalila, maholo gahakau gakoto kuvayingila mumitima yinu, na kujova: ‘Mwaka wa saba ndi mwaka wa kuvalekekesa vandu vemukuvadayi uvi papipi’ na kumuhengela gahakau kwa mlongo winu mngangu na kubela kumpela chochoha, mwene ihotola kumvembela Bambu ndava yinu na yivya kuhoka kububa kwinu. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Mumpela kwa uganu mlongo winu mngangu changali kuvembeneka, Bambu Chapanga yati akumotisa mukila jambu lemuhenga kwa mawoko ginu. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Ndava muni vangangu vivya ku mulima magono goha yati, ndava yeniyo hinu nikuvalagiza muvapela kwa mtima wabwina valongo vinu vangangu, maganu pamulima winu.”<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Namuna ya kuvahengela vavanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 21:1-11">Kuw 21:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />“Ngati mlongo waku Muebulania, mgosi amala mdala, akaguliswa kwaku, yati akakuhengela kwa miyaka sita nambu mumwaka wa saba yati ukumleka awuka. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Na veve paukumelekekesa kotoka kumleka ahamba changali chindu mumawoko. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Mpela kwa mtima wabwina chila cheumotisiwi na Bambu Chapanga waku, ngati mambelele na mabenu na divayi. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Mkumbuka kuvya nyenye mwavili vavanda kumulima wa Misili na Bambu Chapanga winu, avagombwili ndi mana lelu iyi nikuvalagiza mambu aga.”<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />Nambu akakujovela, “Yati niwuka lepi kwaku,” Muni akuganili veve na valongo vaku na iyidakila kutama na veve, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />mtola mbaka pamlyangu, kangi tola lusungulu na kubowola likutu laki luyingila mbaka paubawu wa mlyangu, na mwene yati ivya mvanda waku magono goha gangali mwishu. Mkitila chenicho mewa na mvanda waku wa chidala. <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Kotoka kuwona kunonopa kuleka mvanda ahamba, muni akuhengili mumiyaka sita kwa yapinga ya luhuna lwa mtumisi wa kumlipa. Kita chenicho na Bambu Chapanga waku yati akumotisa mukila leukita.<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vachiveleku va kutumbula va mifuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />“Muwusila Bambu Chapanga waku, vavelekwa voha va kutumbula va chigosi mumsambi wa ng'ombi na mambelele. Kotoka kuzihengesa mahengu ng'ombi zenizo na mambelele na kotoka kudumula mangoma ga mambelele ago. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Kila mwaka veve na valongo vaku yati mwilya hinyama yeniyo palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga winu, pandu peakupahagula. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Nambu chinyama chenicho chikavya na chilema amala ngalola amala chochoha chihakau, kotoka kuchipeleka kuhinjwa ndava teta kwa Bambu Chapanga waku. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Yati yikuvagana kulya mwavene pamiji yinu, mewa vandu voha veviyidakiliwa na Chapanga na vangayidakiwa na Chapanga, vihotola kulya ngati chevilya huluku na mbalapi. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Nambu katu mkotoka kulya ngasi yaki, yeniyo yati mukuyiyita pahi ngati manji.”<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s">Mselebukila mselebuko wa Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Kuw 12:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />“Mselebuka mumwehi wa Abibu yani mwehi wa kutumbula wa mwaka, kuselebukila Pasaka kwa utopesa wa Bambu Chapanga winu. Muni mwehi wenuo Bambu avawusili kumulima wa Misili lukumbi lwa kilu. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Yati muwusa luteta lwa Pasaka kuhuma mumifuya yinu ya mambelele amala ng'ombi kwa utopesa wa Bambu Chapanga pandu peapahagwili mwene ndi mumfugamila. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Mkotoka kulya nyama yeniyo pamonga na mabumunda gegasopiwi ngemeku. Mulukumbi lwa magono saba yati mwilya mabumunda gangasopewa ngemeku ndi mabumunda genago gikemelewa mabumunda ga mang'aiso muni mwawukili ku Misili kanyata, hinu mulukumbi lwoha lwemwitama yati mkumbuka ligono lila pemwawukili ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Mulukumbi lwa magono saba mundu yoyoha pamulima winu akotoka kuvika ngemeku munyumba yaki, na nyama ya chinyama mweawusiwi luteta kimihi ya ligono la kutumbula yikotoka kusigalila mbaka lukela.”<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />“Katu mkotoka kuwusa luteta lwa Pasaka pamuji wowoha weakuvapela Bambu Chapanga winu, <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />nambu yati muwusa pandu palapala ndi Bambu Chapanga winu peihagula pandu pa kumfugamila, penapo ndi pemuwusa luteta lwa Pasaka kimihi, lilanga palitipama, lukumbi ngati lulalula lwemwawukili ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Nyama yeniyo yati mukuyiteleka na kuyilya pandu palapala peahagwili Bambu Chapanga winu, lukela yaki yati muwuyayi mumandanda ginu. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Mumagono sita yati mwilya mabumunda gangali ngemeku, na muligono la saba yati kwivya na mngonganu uvaha wa kumfugamila Bambu Chapanga winu na mkotoka kukita lihengu loloha ligono lenilo.”<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mselebuko wa mabenu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:22">Kuw 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Vala 23:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />“Yati mvalanga majuma saba, yati mtumbula kuvalanga kuhumila ligono la kutumbula kubena mabenu. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />Kangi yati Mselebuka Majuma ndava ya kumtopesa Bambu Chapanga winu, kwa kuwusa luteta lwa kugana kwinu, lwemuwusa kulandana na Bambu cheavamotisi. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Yati muhekelela palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga winu, nyenye pamonga na vana vinu vachigosi na vasikana vinu na vatumisi vinu na Valawi vevavi pamiji yinu na vayehe na vakiva na valipwela vevitama pamonga na nyenye. Mkita chenichi pandu pepahaguliwi na Bambu, ndava ya kumfugamila. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Mkumbuka kuvya mwavili vavanda kula ku Misili, mlanda malagizu kwa uchakaka.”<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mselebuko wa vindanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Vala 23:33-43</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:12-39">Mva 29:12-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />“Mkamala kukusanya mabenu ginu goha na kuminya zabibu zinu, mselebuka Mselebuko wa Vindanda mulukumbi lwa magono saba. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Yati mkita mselebuko wenuwo, nyenye pamonga na vana vinu vachigosi na vachidala na vatumisi vinu na Valawi na vayehe na vakiva na valipwela vemutama nawu mumiji yinu. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Kwa magono saba yati mukumkitila mselebuko ndava ya kumtopesa Bambu Chapanga winu pandu pala peahagwili Bambu. Ndava muni Bambu Chapanga winu yati akuvamotisa nyenye mumabenu ginu goha na mahengu ginu ga mawoko ginu ndi pemwiheka njwee.”<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />“Kila mgosi wa mulima winu yati ibwela palongolo ya Bambu mala zidatu kila mwaka pandu peahagwili: Lukumbi lwa mselebuko wa mabumunda gangali ngemeku na mselebuko wa Majuma lukumbi lwa Mselebuko wa Vindanda. Mundu yeyoha akotoka kuhamba palongolo ya Bambu changali chindu. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Kila mmonga yati iwusa kulandana na mota yevapewili na Bambu Chapanga winu.”<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cheyiganikiwa kuahamula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />“Yati muhagula vahamula pamonga na vatangatila kuhuma mukila likabila linu mukila muji yinu ndi Bambu Chapanga winu, avapelili na vene yati viahamula vandu changali kuvaganisila. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Mkotoka kuyagisa uchakaka, mewa mkotoka kuvya na uganisilu. Mkotoka kuyidakila kutola swinda, muni swinda yikoyosa mihu na kuhamula changaganikiwa kwa mundu angabuda. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Muhamula kwa kulanda gala geigana Chapanga ndu, muni mpata kutola mulima uvya winu wula wemupewili na Bambu Chapanga winu.”<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />“Mkotoka kuyimika nguzo ya mbawu ya chapanga wa chidala Ashela pamuhana ya pandu pa kuwusila teta pemukumjengela Bambu Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Amala mkotoka kuyimika nguzo ya maganga za kuzigundamila michapanga ndava Bambu akuzivenga.”<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />“Mkoto kumhinja ng'ombi amala limbelele mweavi na chilema amala ngati teta kwa Bambu Chapanga winu, ndava muni lenilo likumyomesa mwene.”<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />“Ngati mukayuwanayi kuvya umonga wa muji winu avii mgosi amala mdala mwaikita uhakau palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga na kudenya Lilaganu laki, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />na ahambi kuhengela michapanga yingi na kuyifugamila, amala kufugamila hati lilanga amala mwehi na vindu vingi vya kunani vila vyanangalagiza kufugamila, <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />yikavya mundu avajovili lijambu lenilo ndi mkita umang'omesi chichakaka ngati ndi chakaka lijambu lelilo lihengiki pa Isilaeli, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />hinu mumtola mundu mwenuyo kuvala ya muji na kumtova na maganga mbaka afwayi. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Hati naha yati ikomewa ngati kuvii na vandu vavili amala vadatu vevilola, akotoka kukomewa ngati kuvii na mundu mmonga ndu mweilola. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Vala vevamlolili ndi vevitumbula kumtova maganga ndi vagelekela vangi, ndi chamuleka uhakau pagati yinu.”<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />“Ngati mihalu yiletwa kwinu mumabanji ginu ga mihalu gala geginonopa neju kwinu kugahamula, ngati ukomaji amala madayi amala kulemesana, mugapeleka pandu pepahaguliwi na Bambu Chapanga winu, <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />na kwenuko yati mukumuhambila mteta wa Chapanga yula Mlawi na muhamula mihalu mweavi mulihengu lukumbi lwenulo, na nyenye yati mujova matakilu palongolo yavi, na vene yati vihamula. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Kangi yati mwikita ngati chevakuvajovela pandu pala Bambu Chapanga cheapahagwili, yati mwivya vasadikika kukita goha ngati chemulagaziwi. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Yikuvagana kukita kulandana na malagizu gemwipewa na uhamula weviwusa kwinu. Mkoto kuleka kukita kwa mtima woha uhamula wamukokoselewa mkoto kulinga kung'anamusa uhamula wenou kwa njila yeyoha. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Mundu yoyoha mwangamyidakila mteta wa Chapanga amala chilongosi mweavikwi penapo kumuhengela Bambu Chapanga winu, amala mweanauhotola, ndi mundu mwenuyo iganikiwa akomewa. Ndi chamwikita muni kulekelesa uhakau pagati yinu. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Vandu voha yati viyuwana na kuyogopa na kawaka hati mmonga mweilinga kukita mambu ngati ago.”<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizu kumvala nkosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />Musa akayendelela kuvajovela vandu va Isilaeli, “Pemuyingila mumulima wemupewa na Bambu Chapanga winu, mukayitola kuvya winu na kutama mwenumo, na nyenye mkajova, yati tihagula nkosi atilongosa ngati milima yingi yeyikutitindila, <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />Muhotola kumhagula nkosi, mundu mweihaguliwa na Bambu Chapanga winu. Yati mukumuhagula mmonga wa valongo vinu kuvya nkosi winu, mkotoka kumhagula myehe mweangavya Muisilaeli kuvya nkosi winu. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Hati chenicho, nkosi akotoka kuvya na falasi zamahele ndava yaki mwene, amala akotoka kuvawuyisa vandu ku Misili ndava ya kupata falasi zamahele, ndava muni Bambu Chapanga avabesili, ‘Katu mkotoka kuwuya kwenuko kangi.’ <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Katu akotoka kugega vadala vamahele neju, mtima waki yati ubuda na kumleka Bambu, mewa akotoka kuvya na madini ga feza na zahabu zamahele neju. <verse eid="DEU 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Paitamila pachigoda cha unkosi iganikiwa ayandika chitabu chingi ndava yaki mwene chehihumalila muchitabu cha malagizu palongolo ya vamteta va Chapanga Valawi. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Chitabu chenicho yati ivya nayu magono goha na kuyisoma muwumi waki woha muni apata kujiwula kumfugamila Bambu Chapanga, kwa kulanda na kukamula malovi goha ga mihilu iyi na malagizu. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Malagizu ago yati gakumtangatila akotoka kujikwiha palongolo ya valongo vaki, na kuyagisa malagizu ago kwa namuna yoyoha yila. Ndi mwene pamonga na chiveleku chaki yati viyendelela kulongosa magono gamahele.”<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s">Lilundu la vamteta va Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />“Vamteta va Chapanga vala Valawi, ndi likabila loha la Lawi, yati vivya lepi ugavilu amala uhali wa ndima pamonga Isilaeli. Yati vitama kwa teta zeviwusa vandu ndava ya Bambu za kutinyiswa kwa motu, ndava muni wenuo ndi uhali wavi. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Yati vivya lepi na ndima yavi vene, pagati ya Vaisilaeli, Bambu ndi mweavi ndava yavi ngati chavahadili.”<verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />“Kila vandu peviwusa teta yikavya ngombi amala mambelele. Yati yivya lilundu la vamteta va Chapanga, ndi yati vakumpela mteta wa Chapanga liwondo la kulongolo, njege na mahangau. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Yati mukuvapela mabenu ga kutumbula na divayi na mahuta na mangoma ga mambelele gegiketiwa kwa kutumbula. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Bambu Chapanga ahagwili likabila la Lawi na viveleku vyavi vatumika ngati vamteta va Chapanga, pagati ya makabila magono goha gangali mwishu.”<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />“Ngati Mlawi yoyoha ngati akagana mwene ihotola kuwuka muji wowoha wa Isilaeli na kuhamba pala Bambu peapahagwili ndava vandu vamfugamila, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />na penapo ihotola kukita lihengu la Bambu Chapanga waki, ngati Valawi vangi vevakumuhengela Bambu Chapanga kwenuko. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Yati vipata malundu gavi gegiwanana ga chakulya, pamonga vavii mapati ga maguliso ga vindu vya vandu vavi.”<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabeso ndava ya mivelu ya chiyehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />“Pemwihika pa mulima wula Bambu Chapanga winu akuvapela, mkotoka kulanda mivelu yeyiyomesa vandu va milima yeniyo. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Pakotoka kuvya na mundu yoyoha pagati yinu mwakumuwusa mwana waki mgosi amala mdala pamotu palusaja lwa kuwusila luteta muni avya luteta, amala mundu mweilondola amala mundu mwaiwusa mtela amala muhavi, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />amala muhavi amala mweikwesa mizuka amala mweiyupa mahoka amala vevafwili. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Muni mundu yoyoha mweikita mambu ngati genaga ndi yomeso kwa Bambu, ndava ya matendu aga ga kuyomesa, Bambu Chapanga winu, yati akuvavinga vandu venavo palongolo ginu. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Muvya vasadikika njwee palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga winu.”<verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahadi ya kupewa mlota wa Chapanga wa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Musa akayendelela kujova, “Milima yemukuvavinga na kutalila milima yavi vakuvayuwanila vala vevikita ulondola na kuyupa mahoka. Nambu, Bambu Chapanga winu avabesili kukita chenicho. <verse eid="DEU 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />Bambu Chapanga winu yati akuvahagulila mlota wa Chapanga ngati nene kuhuma kwa Vaisilaeli vayinu, mumuyuwanila mwenuyo.”<verse eid="DEU 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />“Muni chenicho ndi chamwamuyupili Bambu Chapanga winu kuchitumbi Sinai kula, ligono lila pemwabwelili mwavoha pamonga na kujova, ‘Tikotoka kuyuwana kangi lwami lwa Bambu Chapanga witu, amala tikotoka kuuwona kangi motu uvaha uwu, muni tikotoka kufwa!’ <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Ndi Bambu akanijovela, ‘Vajovili uchakaka. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Yati nikuvahagulila mlota wa Chapanga pagati ya Vaisilaeli vayavi avya ngati veve, yati nikumjovela cha kukita, na mwene yati akuvajovela goha genikumlagiza. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Mundu yoyoha mwangayuwanila malovi geijova mlota wa Chapanga mwenuyo gala genamujovili avajovelayi, nene namwene yati nikumbuna. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Nambu mlota wa Chapanga yoyoha mweijova kwa lihina la vachapanga vangi, amala akalinga kujova linenu changali nene kumjovela ajova, mlota wa Chapanga mwenuyo iganikiwa akomewa.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />“Nambu nyenye muhotola kujova, ‘Yati tihotola wuli kumanya linenu langajovewa na Bambu Chapanga?’ <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Ngati mlota wa Chapanga akajova chindu cheangajova Bambu Chapanga, na chindu chenicho chikitika lepi amala chivya lepi chakaka, lijambu lenilo ajovili lepi Bambu Chapanga, mlota wa Chapanga ajovili kwa kuchenjela kwaki na nyenye mkotoka kuyogopa lijambu lenilo.”<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s">Miji ya kujumbalila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Mva 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Yosh 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />“Lukumbi Bambu Chapanga winu, peivya amali kuvakomakesa vandu va mulima wavi na kuvapela nyenye, na pemuvya mumali kuutola uvya winu na kutama munyumba zavi, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />yati muhagula miji hidatu pagati ya mulima weavapelili Bambu Chapanga winu, muni muhitalalila. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Mutengeneza njila na kuulekenganisa mulima pandi zidatu wemupewili na Bambu Chapanga winu, muyitalalilayi, muni yeyoha mweakumukoma mundu changali kugana ahotola kutilalila mwenumo.”<verse eid="DEU 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />“Ngati mundu akamukomayi muyaki changagana, na avii lepi likoko vaki, ihotola kutilalila mu muji umonga pagati ya miji yeniyo hidatu ndava ya kuusangula wumi waki. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Luhumu, mundu mweihamba kudumula sagala na muyaki kudasi, peidumula sagala ndi livagu likaholomoka muchaka, na likamukoma muyaki, mundu mwenuyo ihotola kutilalila mumuji umonga wa miji yeniyo, ndava ya kusangula wumi waki. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Nambu ngati muji wa kutilalila ngauvya mmonga ndu kangi uvi kutali neju ndi yula mweilipisa kwa ligoga ihotola kumlanda amkamula na kumokama mundu mwenuyo mweamkomili muyaki pamonga iganikiwa lepi akomiwayi na venavo vavili vavi lepi makoko penapo kadeni. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Ndava yeniyi ndi nene nikuvalagisa muvagula miji hidatu ya kutilila.”<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />“Ngati Bambu Chapanga winu, ngati yati akuyiyongesa mibaka ya mulima winu, ngati cheavalapakisi vagogo vinu, ni mwene akavapela mulima woha ngati chajovili akuvapela vagogo vinu, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />na nyenye mukakitayi goha genikuvalagisa lelu, mukamugana Bambu Chapanga winu, na kukamula malagizu gaki magono goha, ndi yati muyonjokesa miji hingi hidatu pamonga na hidatu iyi ya hinu. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Mukitayi chenicho muni mundu yeyoha mwangabuda akotoka kukomiwa pamulima weakuvapela Bambu Chapanga uvya winu, na chenicho kuvakita muvya na mhalu wa kukoma.”<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />“Nambu mundu akamvenga mlongo waki, akambajamila na akamzangila na kumkoma, na mwene akatilalila muji umonga wa miji yeniyo, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />penapo vagogo va muji wenuo yati vilagiza vandu vakamukamulayi kuhuma kwenuko kweatilalili na kumugotola kwa mweilipisa kukomiwa lifwa la mundu yungi, na mwene akomiwayi. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Mkotoka kumuhengela lipyana. mundu mweamkomili muyaki. Ngati mwigana kutama kwa uteke, yiganikiwa muvakomayi vevikoma vayavi changali kubuda pa Isilaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mibaka ya kadeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />“Mkotoka kuwusa alama ya mibaka yeyavikiwi kadeni ya vandu vevavii papipi yinu, pamulima wemupewa na Bambu Chapanga winu, muutalalila.”<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vasaidi vajova uchakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />“Linenu la msaidi mmonga lihotola lepi kujova uchakaka kuuvala uhakahu wowoha wa kukoma amala chochoha cheakitili. Giganikiwa malovi ga vasaidi vavili amala vadatu ndi yati yiyidakiliwa. <verse eid="DEU 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Akahumalila msaidi mweigana kumlemasa mundu yungi kwa kumkupakisa ga udesi mundu yungi ndava ya kubuda, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />ndi voha vavili vevikomana vahamba pandu pa kumuyupila palongolo pa Bambu Chapanga, muni vahamuliwa na vamteta va Chapanga na vaamula vevavii mulihengu ligono lenilo. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Vahamula yati vikotakesa mhalu wenuwo bwina, ndi vakamanyayi kuvya msaidi ajovili gaudesi na amtakili gaudesi mlongo waki, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />mukumukitila chilachila ngati yula mweatakiliwi cheaganikiwi kukitiwa. Chenicho ndi chemwisa mambu gahakahu pagati yinu. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Kangi vandu vangi veviyuwana yati viyogopa, na uhakahu ngati wenuwu yati uhengeka lepi kangi kwinu. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Namuna yeniyo mkotoka kuvahengela lipyana vandu ngati venavo, wumi yati ulipipwa kwa wumi na lihu kwa lihu na linu kwa linu na chiwoko kwa chiwoko na chigendelu kwa chigendelu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s">Kuvala ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />“Pemuhamba kungondo kutovana na vamakoko vinu, mwakaziwona falasi na mutuka za ngondo kuhutwa na falasi na manjolinjoli vamahele kuliku nyenye, pena mkotoka kuyogopa. Muni Bambu Chapanga winu mweavawusili ku Misili, yati ivya pamonga na nyenye. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Kwakona mwangatumbula kutovana, mteta wa Chapanga yati ibwela kulongela na vandu va ngondo, <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />‘Nyenye vandu va Isilaeli, muyuwanila! Lelu muhamba kutovana ngondo na vamakoko vinu. Mkotoka kuyogopa na kudenyeka mtima amala kuvagaya, <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />ndava muni Bambu Chapanga winu, mwene ndi mweihamba pamonga na nyenye na yati ikomana na vamakoko vinu ndava yinu na kuvakita nyenye muhotola.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />“Kangi vachilongosi va manjolinjoli yati vakuvajovela vandu, ‘Wu, avi mundu yoyoha apa mweajengili nyumba ya mupya angagona? Awuya kunyumba, ndava ihotola kufwilila kungondo na mundu yungi akayizindula. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Wu, avi mundu yoyoha apa mweana mgunda wa mizabibu angatumbula kubena mizabibu yaki? Awuya kunyumba, muni ihotola kufwila kungondo na mundu yungi akabena na kusangalukila mizabibu ya mumugunda yaki. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Wu, avi mgosi yoyoha apa mweahongili mdala na akona avi papipi kugega? Awuya kunyumba, muni ihotola kufwila kungondo na mundu yungi akagega mdala uyo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />“Kangi vachilongosi vakajova na vandu, ‘Wu, avii mundu penapa mweadenyiki mtima na iyogopa? Awuya kunyumba muni akotoka kuvakita manjolinjoli vayaki vadenyeka mtima ngati mwene.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Lukumbi vachilongosi pevimala kulongela na manjolinjoli, hinu yati vivagula vakulu va manjolinjoli muni kuvalongosa.”<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />“Lukumbi pemwivya papipi kuutova muji, mutumbula hoti kuvakota ngati vigana uteke. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Ngati vandu va muji wenuwo vakaganayi uteke na kubwela kwinu vavya vavanda vinu, hinu yati vakuvahengela kwa kuhenga mahengu geginonopa. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Nambu ngati vandu va muji wenuwo vaganili lepi uteke na nyenye, na vakatovana ngondo na nyenye, ndi yati mukuutindila muji wavi, <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />na mwene Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga winu, akavatangatila kuvahotola makoko vinu pamuji wenuo, penapo muvakoma kwa upanga vagosi voha vevavi mwenumo. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Nambu vadala na vana pamonga na ng'ombi na vyoha vyevivii mwenumo. Mwihotola kuvitola vivya vinu, na nyenye muhotola kuvihengela muni mupewi na Bambu Chapanga winu, kuhuma kwa vamakoko vinu. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Chenicho ndi chemukuhikitila miji yoha yeyivii patali na mulima wemukuutalalila.”<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />“Nambu mumiji ya milima yeakupela Bambu Chapanga waku yivya yinu, komakesa vyoha vyevivi mumi. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Yati mukuvakomakesa vandu voha, Vahiti na Vaamoli na Vakanaani na Vapelizi na Vahivi na Vayebusi ngati Bambu Chapanga winu, cheavalagizi. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Ngati lepi yati vakuvawula kulanda mambu goha ga kuyomesa gevikita kufugamila michapanga yavi, na nyenye yati mukumubudila Bambu Chapanga winu.”<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />“Mukautindilayi muji kwa lukumbi lutali, na kukomana ndava ya kuutola, mkotoka kudumula mikongo ya matunda yeyivii mwenumo kwa livagu. Wu, mikongo yeniyo ndi vandu, mbaka muidumulayi? Mwihotola kulya matunda ga mikongo yeniyo, nambu mkotoka kuyidumula. <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Mwihotola ndu kudumula mikongo yingi yangavya ya matunda na kuyihengela kwa kutindisila muji mbaka muutolayi.”<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s">Kuvala mkomaji angamanyikana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />“Ngati mumukolili mundu akomiwi kudasi mumulima wemupewi na Bambu Chapanga winu, uvya winu, na nyenye mumumanyili lepi mweamukomili, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />Vagogo vinu na vahamula vinu vahuma kuvala ya muji na kupima, utali kuhuma peagoniswi mweafwili mbaka muji wa papipi yaki. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Penapo vagogo va pamuji weuvii papipi na mundu mweafwili yula ndi yati vileta mpapakasi wa ng'ombi yangahenga kuhenga lihengu loloha. <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />Na vene yati vakuupeleka mpapakasi udala mwenuyo kunyasi kwekuvi na kapela kangayuma manji. kwenuko ndima yaki yangalimwa amala kupandwa. Kwenuko vagogo yaki vakuudenya hingu mpapakasi. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Na venavo vamteta va Chapanga va lukolo lwa Lawi viganikiwa vavyai penapo, muni venavo ndi vevahaguliwi na Bambu Chapanga waku, vamuhengelayi na kuvamotisa vandu kwa liina la Bambu, na kuvya vahamula va mihalu na mambu goha kukomana na ukomaji. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Vakamala kudenya hingu ya udala wenuwo ndi vagogo voha vamuji wenuwo weuvii papipi na peagoniswi mundu mweakomiwi uyo, yati visanja mawoko gavi kwa manji panani ya mtuhi wa mpapakasi udala wenuo, <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />na kujova, ‘Tete timkomili lepi mundu uyu, na timumanyili lepi mweamukomili. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Bambu Chapanga, uvalekekesa vandu vaku Vaisilaeli vewavagombwili, kuhuma ku Misili. Utilekekesa na ukotoka kutivalangila vandu vaku Vaisilaeli ukomaji wa mundu mwangabuda.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Ndava yeniyo kwa kukita chenicho cheigana Bambu Chapanga yati mwivalangiwa lepi kubuda ndava ya ukomaji wenuo.”<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvala vadala vevakamuliwi kungondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />“Mukahamba kutovana ngondo na vamakoko vinu, na mwene Bambu Chapanga winu, akavakita muvahotola, na kuvakamula kwa makakala vandu vamahele. <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />Ngati mmonga winu akawonayi mdala wabwina pagati ya vadala venavo vemuvakamwili akamnogela na kugana kumgega ndi amgega avya mdala waki, <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />ndi uhamba nayu kunyumba yaku, kwenuko aketa mayunju na kudumula yugu zaki, <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />ahula nyula zeawalili lukumbi peakamuliwayi. Yati akuvavembela dadi na nyina vaki mulukumbi lwa mwehi woha, kangi uhotola kumhambila na kuvya mgosi waki namwene avya mdala waku. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Nambu ngati uganiswa nayu lepi kangi, umulekayi ahamba cha uteke. Yihotoleka lepi kangi veve kumugulisa amala kumukita kangi ngati mvanda, ndava wamali kugona nayu.”<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhali wa mvelekanu wa kutumbula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />“Ngati avii mgosi mweavi na vadala vavili na akumugana mmonga kuliku yungi na voha vavili vamvelekili vana vagosi na mvelekanu wa kutumbula ndi wa yula mweangamgana, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />na lukahika lukumbi lwa kuwusa uhali, dadi mwenuyo iganikiwa lepi katu kumkitila mwana wa yula mdala mweamganili ngati kuvya mvelekwanu wa kutumbula, pahala pa yula mdala angaganwa yula ndi mbelekanu wa kutumbula. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Yiganikiwa ampela uhali yula mwana mvelekanu wa kutumbula wa mdala yula mweangamgana, ndi ampela gala geiganikiwa. Pandu pa vindu vyaki mala zivili ngati malagizu chegegigana.”<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizu kwa vana vangayidakila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />“Ngati mundu ana mwana wa chigosi mweana ndindani na mweana mang'ang'ala, mweangavayuwanila dadi na nyina vaki pevakumlakalila, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />hinu dadi waki na nyina waki vamukamulayi mwana mwenuyo na vampelekayi kwa vagogo palimulyangu la muji. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Dadi na nyina waki vavajovelayi vagogo va muji kuvya: ‘Mwana witu ana ndindani na akutiyuwanila lepi chetijova na kangi muhutulu na chigaligali.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Penapo vagosi voha va muji wenuwo yati vakumutova maganga msongolo mwenuyo mbaka afwayi, chenicho ndi chemukita ndava ya kuwusa uhakahu woha pagati yinu. Vaisilaeli voha yati viyuwana genago na kuyogopa.”<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizu ndalindali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />“Ngati mundu ahokili libudili lelikumgana kukomiwa mwene akakomiwa, higa yaki yining'iniswa pamkongo, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />mkotoka kuyileka higa yaki yigona pamkongo kilu yoha. Nambu higa yeniyo mzika ligono lilolo. Muni mundu mweafwili kwa kuning'iniswa pamkongo apewili likoto na Chapanga, na nyenye kwa kukita chenicho ndi mwene yati akuubela mulima wemupewili na Bambu Chapanga winu uvyayi uhali winu.”<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />“Ngati ukayiwonayi ng'ombi amala limbelele la mlongo waku Muisilaeli liyagili kotoka kulileka liyaga, likamula ulipeleka kwa mlongo waku. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Nambu ngati kunyumba kwa mkolo chinyama chenicho kutali amala ummanyili lepi mkolo chinyama chenicho, hinu ukuchitola chinyama chenicho chitama kwaku mbaka paibwela mwene, ndi na veve umuwuyisilayi. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Kita chenicho kuvala punda amala nyula amala chochoha cheayagisi Muisilaeli myaku waku katu kotoka kuleka kumtangatila.”<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />“Ukakolelayi chinyama cha Muisilaeli myaku chigwili panjila, lipunda amala ng'ombi kotoka kuleka kutangatila mlongo mwenuyo. Chitangatila kuyimamisa.”<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />“Vadala vakotoka kuwala nyula za chigosi, na vagosi mewa vakotoka kuwala nyula za chidala. Muni Bambu Chapanga winu, akumuyomela mundu mweikita chenicho.”<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />“Ukakolelayi chisakanilu kudasi, chivii kunani ya chikongo amala pahi china makang'a amala mawela na nyina ayuvatili mawela amala makang'a, kotoka kutola nyina pamonga na mawela gaki. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Uhotola kutola mawela nambu nyina mleka ahamba, ukakita chenicho yati umotiswa neju na kutama lukumbi lutali.”<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />“Peujenga nyumba, jenga luwumba mumihana ya chituvilu, muni ukutoka kuwonekana ubudili ngati mundu akagwayi kuhuma kunani na kufwa.”<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />“Kotoka kupanda mgunda umonga mizabibu pamonga na mimea yingi, wakakita chenicho mabenu goha yati givya gangaganikiwa, lepi gala gaupandili ndu nambu mewa na matunda ga mizabibu yati givya gangaganikiwa palongolo ya Chapanga.”<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />“Kotoka kulima mugunda waku kwa kuhengela ng'ombi na lipunda vevakungiwi lingolingoli limonga.”<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />“Kotoka kuwala nyula yeyilukiwi kwa nyuzi zezitenganizwi kwa mangoma ga limbelele pamonga na chitambala chamsopi.”<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />“Kunga mahundu mu kona zoha mcheche za nyula yeuwala.”<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utopesa kwa mambu ga mgosi na mdala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />“Mugosi akagegayi mdala na amali kugona nayu na mwanakandahi akagana kumleka, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />na kumtakila akitili mambu ga soni na nakujova kuvya mwene peamugegili akolili lepi uchakaka wa kumulangisa kuvya angagonekana na mundu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />“Ngati yikahumilayi chenicho dadi na nyina va mdala mwenuyo yati vibwela palimlyangu wa muji kuleta uchakaka wa kulangisa kuvya msikana avii akona angagonekana na mgosi yungi. <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />Hinu, dadi wa msikana yati akuvajovela vagogo, ‘Namgegisi msikana witu mgosi uyu nambu hinu amuganili lepi kavili. <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Hinu akumutakila msikana, ijova kuvya amukolili lepi na ulangisu wa kulangisa kuvya amali kugonekana na vagosi vangi. Nambu niletili uchakaka wa msikana witu kulangisa kuvya avii akona angagonekana na yungi ndi uwu. Ndi dadi waki yati ilangisa nyula yaki kwa vagogo va muji!’ <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Penapo vagogo va muji yati vakumutola mgosi mwenuyo na kumutova ndonga. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Yati vakumulipisa mgosi mwenuyo hipandi miya yimonga ya madini ga feza na kuvapela dadi wa msikana mwenuyo ndava mgosi mwenuyo amvevisi msikana wa Isilaeli. Na mdala mwenuyo yati iyendelela kuvya mdala waki na yati ihotola lepi kumuleka muwumi waki woha.”<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />“Nambu ngati geajovili mgosi mwenuyo ndi gachakaka na kuvii lepi na uchakaka wa kulangisa msikana agonili lepi na mgosi yungi kwakona, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />msikana mwenuyo yati ipelekwa pamulyangu wa dadi waki na vagosi voha va muji waki yati vakumutova maganga mbaka afwayi. Muni akitili lijambu la soni pa Isilaeli kwa kukita ukemi munyumba ya dadi waki kwakona angagegewa. Chenicho ndi chemugunisa uhakahu pagati yinu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />“Mukavakamula ugoni mgosi na mdala wa mundu yungi, penapo voha vavili yiganikiwa vakomewayi. Chenicho ndi chemugunisa uhakahu pagati yinu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />“Ngati mgosi akamkolela msikana mweachumbiwi kubomani na akagonekana nayu, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />yati mukuvahumisa voha vavili pavala ya mulyangu wa muji na muvatova maganga mbaka vafwayi. Msikana mwenuyo iganikiwa akomiwayi ndava hati ngati avii kubomani muni abelili lepi kwa kuyupa vandu vamtangatilayi, na mgosi iganikiwa akomiwayi muni amuhakisi msikana mwachumbiwi na muyaki. Chenicho ndi chemugunisa uhakahu uwu pagati yinu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />“Nambu ngati amkolili msikana mwachumbiwi kumugunda, akamkamula na akagonekana naku kwa makakala, ndi iganikiwa akomiwayi mgosi ndu. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Msikana mwenuyo mkotoka kumukitila chindu chochoha, mwenuyu akiti lepi uhakahu wa kuganikiwa kukomiwa. Muni lijambu lenili liwanangana na mundu mweamkomili muyaki chakugana, <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />muni mgosi mwenuyo amkamwili msikana mwenuyo kumigunda, na pamonga mdala mwenuyo akwesili lwami nambu ahumalili lepi mundu wa kumsangula.”<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />“Ngati vamkoli mgosi akonganeka na msikana mwangahongewa, akamkamkamula na kugona nayu kwa makakala, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />mgosi mwenuyo iganikiwa amulipayi dadi wa msikana mwenuyo hipandi hamusini ya madini ga feza na iganikiwa amugegayi mdala mwenuyo muni amukitili uhakahu, katu ihotola lepi kumuleka muwumi waki woha.”<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />“Katu mgosi yeyoha iganikiwa lepi kugona na mdala wa dadi waki muni yati akumvevesa dadi waki.”<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s">Kuvaguliwa na vandu va Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />“Mgosi yoyoha mweateniwi amala mwadumuliwi lihona laki iganikiwa lepi avya pamonga na msambi wa vandu va Bambu Chapanga.”<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />“Mundu yoyoha mweavelekiwi kuvala ya ndowa mwenuyo pamonga na viveleku vyaki mbaka chiveleku cha kumi viganikiwa lepi kuwungana na msambi wa vandu va Bambu.”<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />“Muamoni amala Mumoabu yoyoha viveleku vyavi vyoha mbaka chiveleku cha kumi viganikiwa lepi kuyingila mumsambi wa vandu va Bambu, <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />muni vabelili kuvapela chakulya na manji pemwavii munjila pemwahuma ku Misili, na muni vampelili swinda Balaamu mwana wa Beoli kuhuma Petoli kwenuko ku Mesopotamia, abwela kuvapela likoto. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Nambu Bambu Chapanga winu, amuyuwanili lepi Balaamu, pahala paki likoto leawusili lang'anamwiki kuvya mota kwinu, muni Bambu Chapanga winu, avaganili. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Hinu katu mkotoka kuvatangatila venavo vapata uteke na wumi wa mota.”<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />“Mkotoka kuvavenga Vaedomu, muni venavo valongo vinu. Mewa mkotoka kuvavenga Vamisili muni mwatamili ku mulima wavi ngati vayehe. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Vana vavi kutumbula chiveleku cha datu vihotola kuyingila mumsambi wa vandu va Bambu Chapanga.”<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvika unyambiso lindanda la vandu va ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />“Pemuhamba kungondo, na kujenga mandanda pandu nunuyu ndava ya kutama kwa lukumbi ndu, kila mundu ajiyangalilayi na chindu chochoha chihakau. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Pagati yinu ngati mundu alotili ndoto na kujitundila mbeyu, iganikiwa ahuma kuvala ya lindanda na akatama patali na lindanda. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Nambu yikahika kimihi asamba, na lilanga likatipamayi ndi ayingilayi mulindanda.”<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />“Pavala ya lindanda mtendekeha pandu pa kuhamba kutunda. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Muvindu vinu vya ngondo muvyayi na ligela, lenilo yati muhengela kugima ligodi na ukamalayi uhilalilayi mahi ginu. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Pandu pemjengili mandanda linu liganikiwa livya lamsopi muni Bambu Chapanga winu, igenda penapo ndava ya kuvayunga na kuvakita muvya na uhotola wa kuvatalalila vamakoko vinu. Mukangamala akoto kulola chindu chochoha chihakahu pagati yinu, muni akalola ihoto kuvaleka.”<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizu ndalindali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />“Mvanda akatilalilayi kwaku kotoka kumuwuyisa kwa mkulu waki. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Mleka atama pagati yinu mumuji wowoha weigana, na mkotoka kumkita vindu vihakau.”<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />Muisilaeli yoyoha mgosi amala mdala, iganikiwa lepi kukita ukemi pandu pa kumuyupila michapanga. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Mashonga geapati mgosi amala mdala kwa kukita ukemi wenuwo, katu gakotoka kuletwa munyumba ya Bambu Chapanga winu, ndava ya kutimilisa nadhili yoyoha, muni Bambu, akuvayomela vandu ngati venavo.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />“Kotoka kumkopesa Muisilaeli muyaku chindu chochoha kwa chiyonjokesu, yivya mashonga amala chakulya amala chindu chingi chochoha cheuhotola kupata chiyonjokesu kwa chindu chenicho. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Wihotola kutola chiyonjokesu kwa muyehe nambu kotoka kutola chiyonjokesu kwa Muisilaeli muyaku, muni Bambu Chapanga waku yati akumotisa mumahengu gaku goha kumulima wemuhamba kuutola na kuvya winu.”<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />“Peuvika nadhili na Bambu Chapanga waku, kotoka kukavila kutimilisa, muni Bambu Chapanga waku yati akuyigana mumawoko gaku, na veve yati uvya na mhalu wa kumbudila Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Nambu ukaleka kuvika nadhili kwa Bambu, ukumbudila lepi Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Nambu uvya msadikika kutimilisa nadhili chewajovili kwa mlomo waku, muni wamuvikili Bambu Chapanga waku kwa kugana kwaku.”<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />“Ngati ukapitayi mumugunda wa mizabibu wa mundu wa mizabibu wa Muisilaeli muyaku uhotola kulya matunda ga zabibu mbaka kuyukuta, nambu kotoka kuyava na kugega muchidengu chaku. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Ngati ukapitayi mumugunda wa Muisilaeli muyaku lelina mabenu uhotola kuhulula mumawoko gaku na kulya, nambu kotoka kugeha kwa chikwakwa.”<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s">Kuleka na kugega kavili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />“Ngati mgosi agegili mdala na peatamili naku akawona kwaki chindu changaganikiwa, na mgosi mwenuyo akamuyandikila balua ya kumuleka akamupela na kumuvinga awuka munyumba yaki, kangi mdala mwenuyo akawuka, <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />na mwanakandahi akawuka kunyumba yaki na ngati igegewa na mgosi yungi, <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />ngati mgosi mwenuyo wa pili akamtola, akamyandikila balua ya kumleka, akampela na kumvinga kunyumba yaki, amala ngati mgosi mwenuyo akafwayi, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />penapo, mgosi wa kutumbula yula ihotola lepi kumugega kavili na kuvya mdala waki, muni amali kuhakaswa. Ngati akamugegayi chenicho yati akumyomesa Bambu Chapanga.”<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizu ndalindali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />“Mgosi mweagegili lukumbi lwa papipi iganikiwa lepi kuhamba kungondo, amala iganikiwa lepi kupewa lihengu lingi loloha, yati ilekwa mulukumbi lwa mwaka umonga muni atama kunyumba na kusangaluka na mdala waki.”<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />“Mundu yoyoha akotoka kutola liganga la pahi amala la panani la kuyagila ndava ya chindu cheakumudayi, muni akakitayi chenicho ndi yati utola vindu vyavi vya kutendelekeha chakulya cha kuvakita vavya mumi.”<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />“Mundu yoyoha akamuyivilayi Muisilaeli muyaki na kumkita avya muvanda waki amala kumugulisa kuuvanda, muhiji mwenuyo iganikiwa akomiwayi. Ndi chemwigunisa uhakahu wenuwu pagati yinu.”<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />“Ngati mundu mmonga pagati yinu umukoli avi na utamu wa mabudi yikuvagana mujiyangalila neju mulanda malagizu genavalagizi vamteta ndi Valawi. Mganikiwa kulanda kwa uchakaka gala genavalagizi. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Mukumbuka chila Bambu Chapanga winu cheamukitili Miliamu pemwahumayi ku Misili.”<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />“Ukamukopesayi mundu wa papipi yaku chindu chochoha kotoka kuyingila munyumba yaki kutola chindu chochoha kuvya poni. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />Uyima kuvala na umlekayi akuletela mwene poni. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Ngati mundu mwenuyo ndi mngangu, kutoka kutama na shuka yaki mbaka kilu yoha. <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />Yiganikiwa umuwuyisila magono goha pelitipama lilanga muni ahotola kujigubika na kukuyupila mota. Kukita chenicho yati liwonekana kuvya lijambu leliyidakiliwa palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga waku.”<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />“Kotoka kuleka kumlipa mngangu mweakuhengela lihengu, akavya Muisilaeli amala mumonga wa vayehe vevitama mumiji yinu. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Umlipa kwa lihengu laki leahengili ligono lenilo magono goha kwakona kutipama lilanga, muni mwene mungangu na ihuvalila malipu genago mu wumi waki, ukabela kukita chenicho, ihotola kumuvembela Bambu Chapanga, ndava yaku na veve yati ulolekana kuvya mbudanu.”<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />“Vadadi vakotoka kukomiwa ndava ya kubuda kwa vana vavi, na vana vakotoka kukomiwa ndava ya kubuda kwa vadadi vavi. Kila mundu yati ikomiwa ndava ya kubuda kwaki mwene.”<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />“Kotoka kukita mambu gangaganikiwa mukuhamula mhalu wa myehe amala wa mkiva, amala mkotoka kutola nyula ya lipwela kuvika poni. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Mukumbukayi nyenye mewa mwavii mwavavanda kumulima wa Misili, na Bambu Chapanga winu, avagobwili kwenuko, ndi mana na nene nikuvalagisa mukita chenichi.”<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />“Pemubena mabenu mumigunda hinu na mukakosiwa mabenu gangi mwenumo, mkotoka kuwuya kugatola, nambu yiganikiwa muvalekela vayehe na vakiva na valipwela, muni Bambu Chapanga winu avamotisa mukila chemwihenga. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Pemwiyava matunda ga mizeituni yinu mkotoka kuwuya kubena kavili zezisigalili, muvalekela vayehe na vakiva na valipwela. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Pemuyava zabibu mumigunda yinu mkotoka kuwuya kuyava kavili zezisigalili, uganikiwa muvalekela vayehe na vakiva na valipwela. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Mukumbuka kuvya na nyenye mwavili mwavavanda ku mulima wa Misili, ndi mana nikuvapeli muhilu uwu.”<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />“Ngati kukavya na vandu vavili vevikomana na vakahamba kulibanji la mihalu na mmonga akawonekana kuvya angabuda, na yungi abudili, <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />Ngati yula mweahamuliwi apewili mbunu wa kutovewa ndonga, ndi muhamula mihalu yati akumjovela agona pahi na kumtovewa ndonga kulandana na kubuda kwaki. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Mwihotola kumutova ndonga alubaini mweabudili nambu mkotoka kuyonjokesa, nambu mukamtovayi neju ya zenizo mwivya mumupeli soni mlongo winu.”<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />“Mkotoka kuyikunga ng'ombi mulomo peyihengeswa lihengu la kuwulula mabenu.”<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cheiganikiwa kukita mlongo ndava ya mundu mweafwili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />“Ngati valongo vavili vitama pamonga na mmonga akafwayi changali kuvya na mwana mgosi, penapo lipwela akotoka kugegewa na mundu wa lukolo lungi. Mlongo waki mweafwili iganikiwa kumuhala lipwela mwenuyo. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Mwana wa kutumbula wavi wa chigosi ndi yati ivalangiwa kuvya mwana wa mweafwili yula, muni lihina laki likoto kuyaga pa Isilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Nambu ngati mlongo mwenuyo wa mweafwili amuganili lepi lipwela mwenuyo, ndi lipwela mwenuyo iganikiwa ahamba kwa vagogo va muji wenuwo na avajovela, ‘Mlongo wa mngana wangu mweafwili ibela kunigega muni niyendelesa lihina la mlongo waki pa Isilaeli, aganili lepi kunikita ngati cheanikitilayi mungana wangu mweafwili.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Penapo vagogo va muji wenuwo yati vakumukemela mgosi mwenuyo na kulongela naku, nambu ngati akona ibela kuvya aganili lepi kumugega lipwela uyu, <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />lipwela mwenuyo yati akumuhambila mlongo wa mngana waki mweafwili palongolo ya vagogo va muji, na kumuhula chilatu chimonga na kumuhunyila mata pamihu na kujova, ‘Chenichi ndi cheyiganikiwa kumuhengela mundu mwaibela kuyendelesa uveleku wa mlongo waki mweafwili.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Valongo va mundu mwenuyo yati vimanyikana pa mulima wa Isilaeli ngati, ‘Valongo va mweahuliwi chilatu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizu gangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />“Ngati vagosi vavili vitovana na mdala wa mgosi mmonga akabwela kumutangatila mngana waki kwa kumukamula kuwotelu mgosi mweitovana na mngana waki, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />mdala mwenuyo mumdumulayi chiwoko chaki, mkoto kumuwonela lipyana.”<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />“Mkoto kuvya na vipimilu vya kupimila vya namuna zivili: Vingi vyevitopa na vingi yeywa mkotoka kutumila vipimu vya udesi. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Mkoto kuvya na vipimilu vivili munyumba zinu, chingi chivaha na chingi chidebe. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Muhengela maganga na vipimilu vya chakaka, muni muhotola kutama miyaka yamahele pamulima wemupewa na Bambu Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Bambu Chapanga winu, akuvayomela vandu vevikita mambu ngati aga.”<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilu ya kuvakoma Vaamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />“Mukumbukayi chevavakitili Vamaleki pemwavii munjila kuhuma ku Misili. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Mkumbuka chavavazangili kunjila pamwavili ngolongondi na kuvatova vala voha vevabwelili mumbele yinu kuni vatotokili. Vaamaleki vamuyogwipi lepi Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Hinu, Bambu Chapanga winu, lukumbi peakuvapumulisa ndava ya kutovana na makoko vinu voha vevakuvatindila pamulima wamupewili na Bambu Chapanga winu, uvya winu, penapo yiganikiwa muvakoma Vaamaleki voha.”<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s">Mabenu gegiwusiwa kwa Bambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />“Mukamala kuhika na kuyingila mumulima wula wemupewa na Bambu Chapanga winu, muni uvya winu na kutama mwenumo, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />mtola pandu pa mabenu goha ga kutumbula gemulimili pandima ya pamulima weakuvapela Bambu Chapanga winu, mugega muchidengu. Mupeleka pandu pala peapahagwili Bambu, Chapanga winu, pavya pa kumuyupila. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Yati ukumuhambila mteta wa Chapanga mweihengela lukumbi lwenulo na umujovela, ‘Lelu nijova palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga witu, kuvya niyingili mumulima wula Bambu Chapanga weavalagazili kwa vagogo vitu kuvya yati akutipela.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />“Mteta wa Chapanga yati akupokela chidengu chenicho mumawoko gaku na kuchivika pahi palongolo ya pandu pa kuwusila teta pa Bambu Chapanga waku, <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />penapo yati uluwula malovi aga palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga waku: ‘Dadi wangu avii Mwalami mwealyungilyungi pandi zamahele, kangi akahamba ku Misili kwenuko atamili ngati muyehe. Kwenuko ahambili na vandu vadebe ndu, nambu vakavya vandu vamahele na vevana makakala na kuvya vandu va mulima weuna makakala. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Nambu Vamisili vatikitili uhakau na kuting'ang'anisa tihenga mahengu geginonopa ngati vavanda. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Kangi tikamuvembela Bambu Chapanga wa vagogo vitu, ndi akayuwanila chivembu chitu. Akagawona mang'aiso geting'aika, na mahengu gitu geginonopa na kulaga. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Hinu Bambu Chapanga kwa uhotola waki na makakala atiwusili ku Misili. Akitili milangisu yamahele yihumalila. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Atiletili penapa na kutipela mulima uwu wabwina na weuna ludaka lwabwina kwa kulima na kwa kudima mifuya. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Hinu nimuletili Bambu mabenu ga kutumbula kuhuma mundima yeanipelili.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 26:10">“Penapo yati uvika chidengu pahi palonglo ya Bambu Chapanga, Chapanaga waku na kumufugamila. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Kangi veve pamonga na Valawi na vayehe voha vevavi pagati yinu yati ugasangalukila muvindu vyoh vyabwina vila Bambu Chapanga waku, gekupelili veve pamonga na vandu va nyumba yaku.”<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />“Kila mwaka wa datu mwiganikiwa kila mundu mweavii kwinu awusayi lilundu limonga pagati ya malundu kumi ga mabenu ginu na kuvapela Valawi na vayehe na vakiva na valipwela muni vahotola kulya na kuyukuta pamiji yinu. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Kangi mjovela Bambu Chapanga waku, ‘Niwusili kuhuma munyumba yangu lilundu lamsopi, nivapeli Mulawi na muyehe na mkiva na lipwela, kulandana na malagizu gaku goha gewaniluwulili. Nileki lepi kukita chaujovili amala kukosiwa. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Nalili lepi lilundu limonga pagati ya malundu kumi lukumbi penavii mumalilu; Nawusili lepi kuvala ya nyumba yangu penavii mwenangayidakiliwa palongolo yaku na nawusili lepi vindu vyenivyo kwa vevafwili. Nikuyuwanili veve Bambu Chapanga wangu, na nikitili goha ngati chewanilagizi. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Ulola pahi kuhuma kunani pandu paku pamsopi, uvamotisa vandu vaku Vaisilaeli na mulima weutipelili ngati chewavahaidili vagogo vitu, mulima wabwina kwa kulima na kudima mifuya.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vandu va Bambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />“Lelu iyi Bambu Chapanga winu, akuvalagisa kugakamula malagizu na mihilu iyi, mukangamala kugakita kwa mtima woha na mpungu waku woha. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Lelu iyi myidakili Bambu kuvya ndi Chapanga winu, na kuvya yati mulanda njila zaki na kuyidakila malagizu gaki na mihilu yaki na kuyidakila lwami lwaki. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Na mwene Bambu lelu avayidakili kuvya nyenye ndi vandu vaki mwene ngati cheavalagizi na kuvya muganikiwa kukamula malagizu gaki goha. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Yati akuvakita nyenye kuvya vandu va mulima uvaha kuliku milima yoha yeawumbili. Na nyenye yati mwikita lihina laki lilumbiwa na kutopeswa. Nyenye yati mwivya vandu vaki mwene ngati chajovili.”<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s">Malagizu ga Chapanga gegayandikwi mumaganga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Hinu, Musa peavii pamonga na vagogo va Isilaeli akavalagiza vandu, “Mukamulayi mihilu yoha yenikuvalagiza lelu. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Ligono lila lemukupuka mfuleni Yoludani na kuyingila mumlima weavapeli Bambu Chapanga winu, yati muyimamisa maganga na kugakilima. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Kangi panani yaki muyandika malovi goha ga mihilu iyi, pemumali kukupuka na kuyingila mumlima wabwina weuganikiwa kwa kulima na kudimila weavalagazili Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa vagogo vinu kuvya yati akuvapela. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Pemumala kukupuka mfuleni Yoludani, yati muyimamisa maganga ago kunani ya chitumbi Ebali, ngati chenikuvalagiza lelu, na kugakilima. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Kwenuko yati mukumujengela Bambu Chapanga winu, pandu pa kuwusila teta kwa maganga. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Mujengayi pandu pakumuwusila teta Bambu Chapanga winu kwa kuhengela maganga gangahongolewa. Panani ya pandu penapo yati mukumuwusila Bambu Chapanga winu teta ya kutinyiswa. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Yati mumuwusila teta za uteke na mulyayi bahapo na muhekelelayi palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Yati muyandika hotohoto panani ya maganga ago malovi goha ga malagizu aga.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Penapo Musa pamonga na vamteta va Chapanga va Valawi vakavajovela Vaisilaeli voha, “Muguna muniyuwanila nyenye Mwavaizilaeli. Lelu nyenye ndi mwavandu vaki Bambu Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Hinu yati mukuliyidakila lwami lwa Bambu Chapanga winu, kulanda malagizu gaki na mihilu yaki yenikuvalagiza lelu.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likoto ndava ya vandu vangayidakila malagizu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Ligono lenilo Musa akavalagiza Vaisilaeli na kujova, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />“Mukamala kukupuka mfuleni Yoludani makabila ga Simeoni na Lawi na Yuda na Isakali na Yosefu na Benyamini yati giyima panani ya chitumbi Gelizimu kuyuwanila Chapanga cheakuvamotisa vandu. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Na makabila ga Leubeni na Gadi na Asheli na Zabuloni na Dani na Nafutali genaga yati giyima panani ya chitumbi Ebali na kuyuwanila chila Chapanga cheakuvapela vandu likoto. <verse eid="DEU 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Na vene Valawi yati vakuvakokosela vandu voha va Isilaeli kwa lwami luvaha.”<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />“ ‘Apewa likoto mundu yoyoha mweitengeneza chimong'omong'o kwa kuhongola amala kwa kukita lufumbu na kufugamila chimfiyu, chindu chechihengiwi na mawoko ga fundi na chechivengiwi na Bambu Chapanga winu.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:15">Na vandu voha vayangula, ‘Ena!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />“ ‘Apewa likoto mundu yoyoha mweakumvevesa dadi waki amala nyina waki.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:16">Na vandu voha vayangula, ‘Ena!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />“ ‘Apewa likoto mundu yoyoha mweiwusa alama mumbaka wa muyaki.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:17">Na vandu voha vayangula, ‘Ena!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />“ ‘Apewa likoto mundu yoyoha mweakumyagisa ngalola munjila.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:18">Na vandu voha vayangula, ‘Ena!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />“ ‘Apewa likoto mundu yoyoha mweiyaagisa uchakaka wa muyehe amala mkiva amala lipwela.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:19">Na vandu voha vayangula, ‘Ena!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />“ ‘Apewa likoto mgosi mweigonekana na mdala wa dadi waki, muni amupeli soni dadi waki.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:20">Na vandu voha vayangula, ‘Ena!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />“ ‘Apewa likoto mundu yoyoha mweigona na chinyama chochoa.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:21">Na vandu voha vayangula, ‘Ena!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />“ ‘Apewa likoto mundu yoyoha mweigonekana na mlumbu waki akavya msikana wa dadi waki amala msikana wa nyina waki.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:22">Na vandu voha vayangula, ‘Ena!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />“ ‘Apewa likoto mundu yoyoha mweigonekana na mkohanu waki wa chidala.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:23">Na vandu voha vayangula, ‘Ena!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />“ ‘Apewa likoto mundu yoyoha mweikoma muyaki chimfiyu.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:24">Na vandu voha vayangula, ‘Ena!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />“ ‘Apewa likoto mundu yoyoha mweitola swinda muni akoma mundu mweangahoka.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:25">Na vandu voha vayangula, ‘Ena!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />“ ‘Apewa likoto mundu yoyoha mweangayidakila malovi aga ga malagizu na kugalanda.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:26">Na vandu voha vayangula, ‘Ena!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s">Mota kwa veviyidakila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">Vala 26:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Ukumb 7:12-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />“Ngati mukaluyuwanila lwami lwa Bambu Chapanga winu, na kukita chiukekesi malagizu genikuvalagiza lelu, mwene yati akuvakita muvya vandu va mulima uvaha kuliku vandu va milima yingi yoha. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Ngati mukaluyidakila lwami lwa Bambu Chapanga winu, ndi yati akuvapela mota zenizi.”<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />“Bambu yati akuvamotisa mukila chemuhenga, mumiji na mumigunda yinu.”<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />“Bambu yati akuvamotisa mpata vana vamahele, mabenu gamahele, na kuvya na ng'ombi na mambelele gamahele.”<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />“Bambu yati akuvamotisa kwa kuvapela mabenu gamahele na chakulya chechihuma mumabenu genago.”<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />“Bambu yati akuvamotiswa pemwikita kila lihengu lemwihenga.”<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />“Bambu yati akuvakita muvahotola vamakoko vinu peviyima na kutovana na nyenye, pevibwela kwa njila yimonga yati vipechengana kutila kwa njila saba.”<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />“Bambu Chapanga, yati akuvapela mota kwa kumemesa vyakulya muvibana vinu na mukila chindu chemwikita kwa mawoko ginu. Yati akuvamotisa mumlima weakuvapela.”<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />“Bambu Chapanga winu, yati akuvakita muvya vandu vaki Chapanga mwene ngati chajovili, ngati mukayidakila mihilu yaki mwene na kulanda njila zaki. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Vandu va milima yoha pevimanya kuvya Bambu Chapanga winu avahagwili nyenye muvya mwavandu vaki yati vakuvayogopa. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />Bambu yati akuvamotisa kwa kuvayonjokesa neju vana na mifuya na mabenu mumiguda, mumulima weavalagazili vagogo vinu kuvya yati akuvapela. <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />Kuhuma yati akuvagubukulila chibana chaki chabwina kuhuma kunani, Bambu yati itonyesa fula, pamulima kwa lukumbi lweluganikiwa, na kuvamotisa mahengu ginu. Yati mukuvakopesa vandu va milima yamahele nambu nyenye yati mwikopa lepi. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />Bambu Chapanga winu, yati akuvakita muvya vachilongosi pagati ya vandu va milima yingi na yati mwilongoswa lepi na vangi. Yati muvya mwavavaha vana vindu vyamahele ndi lepi vangangu, ngati mugakamula malagizu gaki genivapela lelu na kugakita chausadikika. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Nambu katu ukotoka kulinga kubela kuyidakila malagizu na mihilu yeniyi ukotoka kufugamila na kuyihengela michapanga yingi.”<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likoto ndava ya kubela kuyidakila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:14-46">Vala 26:14-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />“Nambu ngati muyidakila lepi lwami lwa Bambu Chapanga winu, amala ngati mukita lepi chaukekesi malagizu gaki goha na mihilu yenikuvalagiza lelu, ndi makoto genaga goha yati gakuvapata.”<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />“Yati mupewa likoto mukila chemuhenga, mumiji yinu na mumigunda ginu.”<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />“Yati vipewa likoto madengu ginu ndava ya kubela kumemesa vyakulya na hyombo vya kutengenezela mabumunda.”<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />“Vana vinu yati vipewa likoto ndava kubela kuvya na vana vamahele na mabenu ga ndima yinu, na mifuya yinu yati yipewa likoto yikoto kuyolokana.”<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Bambu Chapanga yati mupewa likoto mahengu ginu goha gemwihenga.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />“Ngati mwikita gahakau na kumbela Bambu Chapanga, yati akuletela matamu, chitutu na kudumuka mtima mumahengu ginu goha mbaka mkomakiswi na kanyata, ndava ya gahakahu na matendu ginu na ndava ya kumleka Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />Bambu Chapanga yati akuvaletela matamu ndalindali mbaka mwavoha avakomakesa njwee pamulima wemuhamba kuutola uvya winu. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />Bambu Chapanga yati akuvaletela matamu ga kukohomola na utamu na maputi na lupyupu neju na kumalikiwa na kutimbugana na likungu mambu genago yati gakuvahanganila mbaka mufwayi. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Kunani kwa Chapanga yati kwivya lepi na fula pa ndima yati piyuma ngati lyuma. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />Bambu Chapanga, yati akuvakitila lububu na msavati kuvya fula yinu, lububu yati lukuvatova mbaka mufwa.”<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />“Bambu Chapanga, yati akuvakita mubuniwayi na vamakoko vinu. Pemuhamba kukomana yati mukuvahambila kwa njila yimonga, nambu yati mutila na kupechengana kwa njila saba, na nyenye muvya yomeso kwa vandu voha va pamulima. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Pemwifwa hinga zinu yati zivya chakulya cha videge na hinyama kawaka mundu mweibwela kuvivinga. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />Bambu Chapanga, yati akuvatova kwa maputi ngati gala gevapatili Vamisili na kwa vilonda na upele na kutuguta kwangahotoleka kulama. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />Bambu Chapanga yati akuvatova kwa kupenga, yati muvya ngalola na kuvya na mang'amung'amu. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Muhi yati mugenda kwa kupamisapamisa ngati vangalola na yati mumotiswa lepi mugoha gemuhenga. Yati munyagiwa vindu vinu pamahele na kwivya lepi na mundu wa kuvatangatila.”<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />“Yati ugega mdala nambu mgosi yungi yati igona nayu. Mukajengayi nyumba yati yitamiwa na mundu yungi. Yati upanda mizabibu nambu yati ulya lepi nambu yati ilya mundu yungi. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Ng'ombi zinu yati zihinjwa palongolo ya mihu ginu nambu yati mulya lepi nyama zaki. Punda zinu yati zitoliwa kwa makakala kuni mwilola nambu yati muwuyisiwa lepi. Mambelele ginu yati vipewa vamakoko vinu, na yati kuvya lepi na mundu wa kuvatangatila. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Vana vinu va chigosi na vachidala yati vipelekwa kwa vandu va milima yingi na nyenye yati mulindila magono goha vawuyayi nambu yati muvya lepi na makakala ga kuvawuyisa. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Vandu va mulima wangaumanya yati vitola mabenu goha ga ndima yinu na matunda gemugahengili lihengu, na nyenye yati munyagiwa na kung'aiswa magono goha, <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />mbaka yati mwipenga ndava ya mambu gemukugapata. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />Bambu Chapanga, yati akugabuna mafugamilu ginu na magendelu ginu kwa maputi gegivina neju gangahotoleka kulamiswa, yati gidandasika kuhumila kulwayu lwa magendelu ginu mbaka kumutu.”<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />“Bambu Chapanga, yati akuvapeleka nyenye pamonga na nkosi mwemujihagulili mbaka kumulima wemwangatama nyenye amala vadadi winu vautamili lepi, na kwenuko yati mukuyihengela michapanga yingi yeyitenganizwi kwa mikongo na maganga. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Vandu voha vevavi mumilima yeakuvapeleka Bambu Chapanga yati vakuvavenga na kuvavevesa na kuvakangasa.”<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />“Yati mwipanda mbeyu zamahela mumigunda yinu nambu yati mwibena padebe ndu muni mambalanguli yati gilya. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Yati mwipanda mizabibu na kuyikulugila na kuyiyangalila bwina, nambu yati mwibena lepi mizabibu yeniyo mewa divai yaki yati mwinywa lepi, muni yati ziliwa na vingokoko. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Yati mwivya na zeituni pamulima winu woha, nambu yati mwipata lepi na mahuta gaki muni yati zipoloka changakangala. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Yati muveleka vana va chigosi na va chidala nambu yati vivya lepi vinu muni yati vitoliwa kungondo kwa vandu va milima yingi. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Mikongo yinu yoha ya matunda na mabenu ginu goha yati giliwa na mambalanguli.”<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />“Vayehe vevavii pagati yinu yati vivya na vindu vyamahele neju kuliku nyenye nambu nyenye yati mwivya yutiyuti. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Vene yati vakuvakopesa nyenye nambu nyenye mwivya lepi na chindu cha kuvakopesa, vena yati vakuvalongosa na nyenye yati mwivya pahi yavi.”<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />“Makoto aga goha yati gakuvalandalila na kuvakolela nyenye mbaka mukomakeswa muni mwaluyidakili lepi lwami lwa Bambu Chapanga winu, na mwakamwili lepi malagizu gaki na mihilu yeavapelili. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Mambu genago yati givya ulangisu wa mang'aiso ga Bambu Chapanga kwinu na kwa viveleku vinu magono goha gangali mwishu. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Ndava muni Bambu Chapanga winu, peavamotisi kwa mota ndalindali, nyenye mwamuhengili lepi kwa kuhekelela na kwa mtima waku woha. <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />Bambu Chapanga, yati akuvaleta vamakoko kwinu na nyenye yati mukuvahengela. Na nyenye yati muvya na njala na njota na changawala na kwa ungangu wa vindu vyoha, mwene yati akuvakunga lingolingoli la lyuma musingi zinu na makoko venavo yati vakuvahengesa mahengu geginonopa mbaka vavakomekesa. <verse eid="DEU 28:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />Bambu Chapanga yati akuvaletela vandu va mulima wa kutali, kuhuma kumwishu wa mulima, ngati linditi chelihelela kanyata kuzingila, vandu vemwangamanya chevilongela. <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />Vandu va mulima wenuo, veviyogopesa pamihu, vakuvawonela lepi lipyana vagogo amala vasongolo. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Nyenye yati mwifwa na njala. Yati vakuvalekela lepi vyakulya amala divayi amala mahuta amala ng'ombi amala mambelele mbaka vavakomakesa. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Vandu venavo yati vakuvatindila pandi zoha za miji yinu pamulima wemupewili na Bambu Chapanga, na luwumba zinu zemukuzihuvalila yati zigwiswa mbaka pahi.”<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />“Lukumbi pemutindilwa na kung'aiswa na vamakoko vinu, yati mwivya na njala mbaka mwilya nyama ya vana vinu vemupewili na Bambu Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Hati mundu mngolongondi neju mwealeliwi bwina yati akumnyima chakulya mlongo waki, mdala waki mwamganili na vana vaki mweisigalila, <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />na mwene yati akumupela lepi hati mundu mumonga nyama ya vana vaki veakuvalya. Yati chisigalila lepi chindu chochoha ndava yinu lukumbi vamakoko pavakuvatindila na kuvang'aha pamiji yinu yoha. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Hati mdala mweavi na vindu vyamahele na mwealeliwi bwina, yula angalinga kugenda kuhamba kwokwoha yati ikita chichocho. Mwene yati ivya munotaji kwa mngana waki mweamuganili na kwa msikana waki, <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />lukumbi lwenulo lwa kuzangilwa, yati akumulya mwana waki mng'enya pamonga na litumbu lelihuma pamwishu peimala ndu kuveleka, changali hati mngana waki mweamuganili kumanya amala mwana waki kumanya.”<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />“Ngati mwangavya vasadikika kukita malovi goha ga mihilu iyi gegayandikwi muchitabu ichi na ngati mwangalitopesa na kulilumba lihina likulu na leliyogofwa la Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga winu, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />hinu Bambu Chapanga yati akuvaletela nyenye pamonga na vana viveleku vinu mbunu wangalolekana, mang'aiso gakulu gangalamiswa kwa miyaka yamahele, na matamu gakulu kwa miyaka yamahele. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Yati akuvaletela kangi matamu gala gemwayogopayi kumulima wa Misili, na genago yati gimalika lepi magono goha. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga yati akuvaletela matamu ndalindali na mang'aiso gangi gala gangayandikwa muchitabu ichi cha malagizu mbaka mkomiwayi. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Pamonga kuvya nyenye ndi mwavamahele ngati ndondo za kumahundi, nambu yati mwivya mwavadebe ndu muni mwahiyidakili lepi Bambu Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Ngati cheyamuganisi Bambu Chapanga kuvapela mota na kuvakita muyonjokesa kuvya mwavamahele, ndi cheyikumganisa kuvakitila mambu gahakahu na kuvakomakesa. Na nyenye yati muhumiswa mumulima wula wemwihamba kuutola uvya winu.”<verse eid="DEU 28:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />“Bambu Chapanga yati akuvapechengana mumilima yoha, tangiya upandi umonga wa mulima mbaka wungi na kwenuko yati mukuhifugamila michapanga hingi yeyitengenizwi kwa mikongo na maganga, mwangaifugamila nyenye na vadadi vinu mewa vayimanyili lepi. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Pagati ya vandu va milima yeniyo yati mwitama lepi yegwa amala kujova pandu apa ndi pitu tavete. Nambu kwenuko Bambu Chapanga yati akuvapela wogohi mumitima yinu, na mihu gangalola bwina na kulyungalyunga kwa mtima. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Yati mwitama cha kulyungalyunga magono goha kuvya makoko vinu yati vakuvakoma. Mwivya na wogohi muhi na kilu amala yati mwivya lepi na uchakaka wa wumi. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Mitima yinu yati yimema wogohi na yati mukuchiyogopa kila chemukuchiwona. Lukela yati mwijova mbanga ngayivye kimihi, na peyihika chimihi mwijova mbanga ngayivye lukela. <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />Bambu Chapanga yati akuvakweha muwatu na kuvawuyisa ku Misili, lugendu lweajovili kuvya yati mwihamba lepi kavili. Kwenuko yati mlinga kujigulisa mwavene kwa vamakoko vinu muvya vavanda, nambu kawaka mundu mweakuvagula nyenye.”<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s">Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga na Vaisilaeli ku mulima wa Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />“Aga ndi malovi ga lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga geamlagisi Musa akita na Vaisilaeli ku Moabu, leka lila leakitili nawu ku Sinai.”<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Musa akavakemela Vaisilaeli voha akavajovela, “Mwagaweni goha Bambu Chapanga geamuhengili nkosi wa Misili na vatangatila vaki na vachilongosi vevavi pahi yaki na vandu voha va mulima waki. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Kwa mihu ginu mwavene mwalolili ulangisu na makangaso na gachinamtiti gavaha geakitili. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Nambu mbaka lelu Bambu Chapanga avapelili lepi luhala lwa kumanya wala mihu ga kulola wala makutu ga kuyuwana. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Nene navalongwisi nyenye kulugangatu kwa miyaka alubaini, nyula zemwawalili na vilatu vya mumagendelu ginu vyalalili lepi. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Mwalili lepi libumunda amala kunywa divayi amala kunywa chechigalisa, muni muhotola kumanya kuvya Bambu Chapanga ndi Chapanga winu. <verse eid="DEU 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Na pemwahikili pandu apa vabwelili Sihoni nkosi wa ku Heshiboni na Ogu nkosi wa ku Bashani vabwelili kukomana na tete, nambu tavatovili, <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />ndi tikautola mulima wavi, tikagapela makabila ga Lebeni na Gadi na yapinga ya likabila la Manase uvya mulima wavi. <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Hinu mkangamala kukamula malovi goha ga lilaganu lenili muni mambu ginu gavahambila bwina.”<verse eid="DEU 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />“Lelu muyimili palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga winu, nyenye mwavoha mwavachilongosi va makabila na vagogo vinu na vayimamila vinu na vagosi vangi voha va Isilaeli, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />pamonga na vana vinu na vadala vinu na vayehe vevitama pamonga na nyenye vevakuvabayulila sagala na kuvanegela manji. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Muvii apa lelu iyi kukita lilaganu lila Bambu Chapanga winu ikita na nyenye lelu, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />kuvya yati ilangisa uchakaka lelu kuvya nyenye ndi mwavandu vaki na mwene avya Bambu Chapanga winu, ngati cheavalapalili nyenye na vagogo vinu: Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Nikita lepi lilaganu ili na chilapu ndava yinu ndu na kuluwula likoto laki, nikita lepi ndava ya vala ndu vevavili pamonga na tete lelu palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga witu, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />nambu mewa nikita na vala vevangavya apa pamonga na tete lelu.”<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />“Nyenye mwavene mumanyili chetatamili kumulima wa Misili na chila chetapitili pagati ya vandu va milima yingi mbaka kuhika apa. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Mwaviweni vimong'omong'o vyavi vyeviyomesa ndi michapanga yeyitengenizwi kwa mikongo na maganga na madini ga feza na zahabu. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Mujiyangalila pagati yinu akoto kuvya mgosi amala mdala, mlongo amala likabila loloha lelikumleka Bambu Chapanga witu, na kuhamba kufugamila michapanga ya milima yingi. Lijambu lenili yati livya ngati mkiga weumelisi mkongo na kupambika matunda gavavanu na gegana chimatila. <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Pemmala kuyuwana malovi ga lilaganu lenili lemlapiswi, na mundu akajijovela mumtima waki kuvya nivi bwina kuni ihamba na njila zaki mwene, lenilo yati likuvakoma voha vahakahu na vabwina. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />Bambu Chapanga yati akumlekekesa lepi mundu mwenuyo, ligoga na wihu waki yati viyaka panani ya mundu mwenuyo, makoto goha gegayandikwi muchitabu ichi yati gakumpata, na Bambu Chapanga yati akuliwusa liina la mundu mwenuyo kuhumila pamulima. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />Bambu Chapanga yati akumvagula mwene kuhuma mumakabila goha ga Isilaeli muni apatwa na matovilu kulandana na makoto goha gegayandikwi muchitabu ichi cha malagizu.”<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />“Muviveleku vinu vyoha vyevibwela, vana vinu na vayehe kuhuma kumilima ya kutali yati vilola Bambu Chapanga cheavapeli mulima uwu matovilu na mang'aiso. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Mulima woha yati wivya ngati lugangatu, yati umemi mngwala na mwinyu, utinyiki na kawaka chechisigalili, vandu vapandili lepi mbeyu na kawaka chochoha chechimelili. Ndi ngati cheyavili lukumbi Bambu Chapanga cheakomakisi Sodoma na Gomola na Adima na Seboimu, kwa ligoga laki likali. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Vandu va milima yoha yati vikota, ‘Ndava kyani Bambu Chapanga avakitili naha vandu va mulima uwu? Ligoga yeniyi yivaha yilangisa kyani?’ <verse eid="DEU 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Vandu yati viyangula, ‘Vakitiwi chenichi muni vadenyili Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga wa vagogo vavi, mweavikili nawu lukumbi peavawusa kuhuma kumulima wa Misili, <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />na vandu venavo vakahamba kuihengela na kuifugamila michapanga yingi, yila vangayimanya pakutumbula amala Bambu Chapanga avapelili lepi. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Penapo ndi Bambu Chapanga akavayomela neju vandu va mulima uwu na kuvapela makoto goha gegayandikwi muchitabu ichi. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />Ndi Bambu Chapanga avayomili neju na akavawusa pamulima wavi na akavataga kumulima wungi ngati cheyivii lelu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />“Mambu ga mfiyu ndi ga Bambu Chapanga witu, nambu gala gegagubukuliwi ndi gitu na viveleku vitu magano goha gangali mwishu, muni tihotola kugahengela lihengu malovi ga malagizu aga.”<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s">Huvalila yabwina kwa magono gegibwela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Musa akayendelela kujova, “Nivapeli muhagula mota amala likoto. Mambu genaga goha pegakuvakolela kula kwemwitama kumulima wula Bambu Chapanga kweavapechanginisi yati mukumbuka kuhagula gala genivapelili. <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />ngati nyenye na viveleku vinu yati mumuwuyila Bambu Chapanga winu kwa mtima winu woha na kuyidakila mihilu yaki yenivapeli lelu, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />ndi Bambu Chapanga winu, yati akuvawonela lipyana na kuvawuyisila mambu ginu gabwina na yati akuvavika pamonga kuhuma mumilima yeavapechangini na kuvakita mambu ginu gavahambila bwina kavili. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Hati ngati mpechangini pandu patali neju pamilima, Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga winu yati akuvika pamonga na kuvawuyisa, <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />mwene Bambu Chapanga yati akuwuyisila mulima wewavi wa vagogo vaku, veve yati ukuutola kuvya waku. Mwene yati akukita mambu gaku gakuhambila bwina neju na kuvakita muvya vamahele kuliku vagogo vinu. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />Bambu Chapanga winu yati akuvakita nyenye pamonga na viveleku vinu muvya na mitima yeyikumuyidakila muni mumgana mwene kwa mitima yinu yoha na mipungu yinu yoha na muhotola kutama. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />Bambu Chapanga winu, yati iwusa makoto genago kuhuma kwaku na kuvakolela makoko vinu vevavang'ahili. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Na nyenye mukumyidakila Bambu Chapanga na kukamula mihilu yaki yoha yenikuvapela lelu. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga winu yati akuvakita mambu ginu gavahambila bwina mukila chemwikita, yati mwivya na vana vamahele na ng'ombi zamahele na migunda yinu yati yipambika mabenu. Muni yati igana kangi mpata vindu vymahele ngati chaganayi kuvakita vagogo vinu vapata vindu vyamahele, <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />ngati ndu muyidakila na kuhenga malagizu gaki gegayandikwi muchitabu chenichi cha malagizu na kumuwuyila Bambu Chapanga winu kwa mitima yinu yoha na kwa mipungu yinu yoha.”<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />“Muni mihilu yenikuvalagiza lelu yinonopa lepi kwinu amala yivi lepi kutali na nyenye. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Zivii lepi kunani kwa Chapanga mbaka mujove, ‘Yani mweikwela kunani kwa Chapanga kutiletela na kutikokosela muni tiyidakila?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Amala gavi lepi kumwambu ya nyanja, mbaka mujove yani, ‘Mweikupuka kuhamba kutitolela muni atikokosela na tiyidakilayi?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Lepi, nambu gavii papipi na nyenye neju, gavii mumilomo yinu na mumitima yinu muhotola kuziyidakila.”<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />“Yuwanila, lelu nivapela muhagula pagati ya gabwina na gahakahu, pagati lifwa na wumi. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Nikuvalagiza lelu kuvya mumgana Bambu Chapanga winu, mukita geigana mulanda malagizu gaki na mihilu yaki, penepo ndi pemutama na kuyonjoseka. Bambu Chapanga winu, yati akuvamotisa mumulima wemuhamba kuutola uvya winu. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Nambu mukakongewayi na kubela kumuyuwanila, na mukahutwa kufugamila na kuyigundamila michapanga yingi, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />nikuvajovela yati mukomiwa. Yati mutama lepi kwa lukumbi lutali kumulima wemwihamba kuutola uvya winu, kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Lelu nikuzikemela kunani na pamulima vibwela kuvya msaidi kuvya nivapeli muhagula lifwa amala wumi, ndi pagati ya na mota amala likoto. Nambu muhagula wumi muni muhotola kutama, <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />na muhotola kumugana Bambu Chapanga winu, muyidakila linenu laki na mumulanda, muni kwakukita chenicho yati mwitama miyaka yamahele pa mulima ndi Bambu Chapanga winu avajovili vagogo vinu, yati akuvapela Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo kuvya yati akuvapela.”<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s">Yoshua ivya pahala pa Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 27:12-23">Mva 27:12-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Kangi Musa akayendelela kulongela na Vaisilaeli, <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />akavajovela, “Hinu nivii na miyaka miya yimonga na ishilini na nihotola lepi kuvalongosa nyenye neju, Bambu Chapanga anijovi yati nikupuka lepi mfuleni Yoludani. <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />Bambu Chapanga winu yati akuvalongolela na kuvakomakesa vandu vevitama kwenuko, muni muhitalalila mulima wavi, na Yoshua ndi mweakuvalongosai ngati cheajovii Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />Bambu Chapanga, yati akuvakomakesa venavo ngati cheavakomakisi Sihoni na Ogu, vala vankosi va Vaamoli pamonga na mulima wavi. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />Bambu Chapanga, yati akuvahotosa muvahotola, na nyenye muganikiwa muvakitila ngati chenivalagizi. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Muvyayi vakangamala na ukekesi, katu mkotoka kuvayogopa amala kuyogofya nawu, muni Bambu Chapanga winu ndi mweihamba pamonga na nyenye. Chakaka yati ileka lepi kuvatangatila amala kuvataga.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Penapo Musa akamkemela Yoshua, akamujovela palongolo ya vandu voha va Isilaeli, “Uvya ngangali na ukotoka kuyogopa, muni veve yati ukuvalongosa vandu ava kuhamba kuutola mulima uvya wavi wula Bambu Chapanga avalagazili vagogo vavi na veve yati ukuvapela uvya wavi. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />Muni Bambu Chapanga mwene ndi yati akuvalongosa mwene yati ivya pamonga nawu, katu yati akuvaleka lepi. Ndava yeniyo ndi mkotoka kuyogopa amala kuvya yutiyuti.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusoma malagizu kila pehimalika miyaka saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Penapo Musa akayandika malagizu genago na akavapela vamteta va Chapanga va lukolo lwa Lawi lihengu lavi kugega Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga, pamonga na vagogo voha va Isilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Kangi Musa akavalagiza akajova, “Kila mwishu wa mwaka wa saba yati yivya ndi lukumbi lwa kulekekesa madeni, lukumbi lwa Mselebuko wa Vindanda, vya mwaka wenuwo. <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />Malagizu aga yati mukuvasomela Vaisilaeli lukumbi pevibwela pandu pa kumuyupila Bambu Chapanga pala peapahagwili. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Muvakemala vandu: Vagosi voha na vadala na vana pamonga na vayehe vevitama mumiji yinu, muni voha vayuwanila malovi aga ga kujiwula kumtopesa Bambu Chapanga winu, na kuyidakila kwa usadikika ngati chegigana malagizu aga. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Ngati mwikita ago, viveleku vyavi vangayuwana malagizu ga Bambu Chapanga winu, vahotola kuyiyuwana. Na kujiwula kumyidakila lukumbi lwoha lwemwitama pamulima wemuhamba kuutola uvya winu kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizu ga mwishu ga Chapanga kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, “Hinu ligono laku la kufwa lihegalili. Mkemela Yoshua, na ubwela naku mbaka palindanda lamsopi muni nimupela malagizu.” Musa na Yoshua vakahamba mulindanda lamsopi, <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />na Bambu Chapanga akavahumalila mwenumo mulipanda la lihundi lelayimili panani ya mulyangu wa kuyingilila mulindanda lamsopi.<verse eid="DEU 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Bambu Chapanga akamujovela Musa, “Lukumbi lwaku lwa kufwa luhegalili, na ukamala kufwa vandu yati vitumbula kunileka na kuyihambila michapanga yingi ya mulima wenuwo wevihamba kutama. Yati vakunileka na yati videnya lilaganu lenilagini navu. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Ligono lenilo yati nikuvayomela venavo na kuvaleka, na yati nikuvatangatila lepi, na venavo yati vikomakeswa. Ng'ani zamahele na mang'aiso yati gakuvakolela mbaka vamanya kuvya gahakahu genago gavakolili ndava muni Chapanga avi lepi pamonga nawu. <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Chakaka yati nikuvatangatila lepi kavili, muni vakitili mambu gahakahu na vayigundamili michapanga yingi.”<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />“Hinu uyandika lunyimbu ulu na uvawula Vaisilaeli na vauyimbayi, muni uvya usaidi wangu wenijova kwavi. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Penimala kuvayingisa mumulima weuvi bwina kwa kulima na kudimila mifuya, ngati chenavahaidili vagogo vavi. Na mambu gavi gavahambila bwina na kukulupala, yati vakuing'anamukila michapanga yingi na kuyifugamila. Na vene yati vakunivevesa na kubela kukita lilaganu langu. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Lukumbi pezikuvabwelela matovilu na ng'ani, lunyimbu ulu yati luyendelela kuyibwa na kuvya usaidi kwavi, pamonga na viveleku vyavi. Nimanyili chevigana kukita hati kwakona vangayingila mumulima wenavalapakisi kuvapela.”<verse eid="DEU 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Ndi Musa akayandika lunyumbu lula ligono lilalila na akavawula Vaisilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akamulagiza Yoshua mwana wa Nuni akamjovela, “Uvya mkangamala na mkekesi, muni yati ukuvalongosa Vaisilaeli kuhamba kumulima wenavalapakisi kuvapela, na nene yati nivya pamonga na veve.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Musa peamali kuyandika malagizu genago muchitabu tangiya kutumbula mbaka pa mwishu, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />akavajovela Valawi vevii na lihengu la kugega Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />“Muchitola chitabu ichi cha malagizu, muchivika pamuhana ya Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga winu, muni chivya usaidi wa kuvavala nyenye. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Muni nivamanyili chemung'anamuka na chemuvi na ndindani. Yikavya mumubudili Bambu Chapanga kwakona nene kufwa, yati yivya wuli nikamala kufwa? <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Muniletela palongolo yangu vagogo voha va makabila ginu pamonga na vachilongosi vinu muni penijova malovi aga vayuwana kwa makutu gavi, kunani na pamulima zivya vasaidi kuvavala vene. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Muni nimanyili kuvya nikamala kufwa chakaka nyenye yati mwivya mwavahakahu na mukuyileka njila yila yenavawulili muyilanda. Na magono gegibwela yati mubwelewa na gahakahu muni mukita gangaganikiwa palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga na mukumuyomesa kwa matendu ginu.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lunyimbu lwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Kangi Musa akagasoma malovi ga lunyimbu ulu palongolo ya mkonganiku la Vaisilaeli voha viyuwana.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />“Yuwanila malovi gangu veve kunani kwa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:1">na veve mulima yuwanila, malovi genijova.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Mawuliwu gangu yati gihelela ngati madonyo ga fula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">malovi gangu yati gihelela ngati mbetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">Ngati muwela mumabenu gangakangala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">ngati fula yeyitonya mbolimboli mumahamba gavisi.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Muni yati nikulilumba na kulikokosa lihina la Bambu Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:3">Yati nikuvajovela vandu, ndava ya ukulu wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />“Mwene ni muhotola mweakuvayunga, mahengu gaki gatimiliki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">njila zaki zoha ndi za chakaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">mwene ni Chapanga msadikika mweangabuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">mwene ikita mambu bwina, changali kumganisila mmonga.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Nambu nyenye mwavasadikika lepi kwaki, nyenye mwiganikiwa lepi kuvya vana vaki, ndava ya uhakahu winu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">nyenye ndi mwachiveleku chihakahu na chechiyagili.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Wu, yeniyi ndi njila ya kumulipa Bambu Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">nyenye mwavandu vayimu na mwangali luhala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Wu, mwene lepi Dadi winu mweavawumbili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">mwavakitili na kuvawumba?<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />Mukumbukayi lukumbi lwelupitili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">muhololela viveleku vya kadeni vyevipitili, muvakota vadadi vinu yati vakuvajovela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">muvakota vagogo vinu yati vakuvajovela gegapitili.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Mweavi kunani peavapelili vandu va milima yingi pandu pakutama pavya pavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">peavagavanisi vandu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">avikili mibaka ya vandu kulandana na mvalangu wa vandu va Isilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Muni Chapanga ajivikili vana va Yakobo vavya vaki, venavo ajihagulili kuvya vaki.”<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />“Avakolili kumulima wa lugangatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">lugangatu lwangali chindu lwelubuma mpungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">akavayunga na kavavika bwina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">Ngati mundu cheiyunga lihu laki.”<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Ngati linditi chelikuvawula mawela gaki kumbululuka, akuvakamula bwina kuni adandisi magwaba gaki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">Bambu Chapanga, avayungili bwina Vaisilaeli muni vakotoka kugwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />Bambu Chapanga mwene ndu ndi mweavalongwisi vandu vaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:12">na pavii lepi Chapanga yungi wa kumtangatila.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />Avapitisi pandu pepayinwiki pa pamulima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">vakalya mabenu ga kumigunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">Vakalya wuchi wa mulitalau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">na mahuta ga zeituni kuhuma mundima yeyivi na maganga.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Ng'ombi zavi na mene zavi vahumisi mavele gamahele neju,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">vavi na mambelele gabwina na mene na ng'ombi za Bashani na mene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">akavapela nganu yabwina neju na divayi yamupya vakanywa.<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />“Vandu va Isilaeli vawene na kung'anamukila Chapanga, vakakulupalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">na kumema maleme na kunekenala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">kangi vakamuleka Chapanga mweavawumbili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">vakamvevesa litalau la usangula wavi.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Vakamukita Chapanga avya na wihu na ligoga ndava vene vifugamila michapanga yavi miyehe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">Vakamuyomesa neju ndava ya vimong'omong'o vyavi vya kuyomesa.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Vayiwusili teta za kutinyiswa kwa mizuka yila yeyangavya chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">vayihambalili michapanga yavangayimanya katu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">michapanga yamupya yeyahumalili magono ga papipi, michapanga yeniyo hati vagogo vavi katu vayifugamili lepi.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Mukamuleka Litalau mweavapelili wumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">mukamukosiwa Chapanga mweavaveliki.”<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />“Bambu Chapanga akalilola lijambu lenilo akayoma na akavaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:19">akavabela vana vaki vagosi na vadala.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Akajova, ‘Yati nikuvatangatila lepi,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">Nilola mwishu wavi uvya wuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">muni vene ndi chiveleku chechiyagili, vana vangali sadika.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Vanikohakisi niwona wihu kwa chindu changavya Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">na kuniyomesa ndava ya vimong'omong'o vyavi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">Hinu yati nikuvakita vavawonela wihu vandu vangavamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">yati nikuvayomesa kwa kuhengela vandu vayimu.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Ligoga langu iyaka ngati motu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">yati uyocha vindu vyoha mbaka ku mlima wa vevafwili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">Yati niyocha njwee mulima na vyevivili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">yati yitinyisa mikingisa ya vitumbi.”<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />“ ‘Yati nivika matovelu gamahele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:23">na yati nikuvatova mbaka migoha yangu yimalika.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Yati vifwa kwa njala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">yati vikomiwa kwa utamu uhakahu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">Yati nipeleka hinyama yeyivi na minu gakali gavazangila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">na mayoka gegana chimatila neju gavalumayi.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Yati mkomiwa kwa ngondo munjila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">na munyumba zinu yati zivya na wogohi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">Vasongolo na vakasikana vinu yati vikomiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">hati vana vevinyong'a pamonga na vagogolo vevana hulia.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Najovili nganivakomakisi njwee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:26">na kukita vandu voha vavakosiwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Nambu ndu navalekili lepi makoko vavi vameka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">kuvya ndi vevahotwili vandu vangu lukumbi nene namwene ndi mwenikitili mambu aga.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />“Vandu va mulia wa Isilaeli vangali luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:28">vandu avo vangali ubwina mugati yavi.”<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Ngavavi na luhala ngavamanyili ndava kyani vahotwili lepi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">ngavahotwili kumanya mwishu wavi yati uvya wuli.<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Linjolinjoli mmonga wa likoko ihotola wuli kuvavinga manjolinjoli elufu yimonga wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">amala manjolinjoli vavili va makoko vihotola wuli kuvavinga manjolinjoli elufu kumi va Isilaeli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Nambu ngati Litalau wavi avatagili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Bambu Chapanga wavi avalekili.<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Hati vamakoko vitu vijova hotohoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:31">chapanga wavi avi lepi na makakala ngati Chapanga witu wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Muni makoko wavi vahalabiki kwa mahakau ngati Sodoma na Gomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">vavi ngati mizabibu yeyipambika mtunda gakali na gegana chimatila,<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />divayi yavi ndi ngati yitenganezwi kuhuma muchimatila chikali cha mayoka.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />“Bambu Chapanga ikumbuka gala gevakitili vamakoko vaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:34">ndi ilindila lukumbi chakaka muni avabuna.<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Nene ndi mwenilipisa yati nikuvabuna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">lukumbi lwavi lwa kubuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">kukomiwa kwavi kuhikili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">mwishu wavi ukuvabwelela kanyata. <verse eid="DEU 32:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />Bambu Chapanga yati akuvakengelela vandu vaki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">na kuvawonela lipyana vahengaji vaki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">Lukumbi peiwona makakala gavi gamaliki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">amala kawaka mweisigalili mkungiwa amala mwealekekiswi.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Ndi Bambu Chapanga yati akuvakota vandu vaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">Yivii kwoki yila michapanga hinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">Litalau lemwayijumbalili muni muvya wumi? <verse eid="DEU 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Yivi kwoki michapanga yemwayipelili teta zinu za kutinyisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">na kunywa divai yinu yeyavi teta ya mnyeso?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">Hinu yiyima kuvatangatila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">mleka yibwela kuvayunga.”<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />“ ‘Mulolayi kuvya nene ndi Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">na kawaka yungi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Nene nikoma na kuvika mumi, nilemasa na nilamisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">kawaka mweihotola kumusangula mundu yeyoha kuhuma mumawoko gangu.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Niyinula chiwoko changu kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">na kulapa kwa liina langu la magono goha gangali mwishu,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />lukumbi penikulinola upanga wangu weung'asima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">na kugolosa chiwoko changu kuvahamula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">Yati nikuvalipisa vamakoko vangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">yati nikuvabuna vala vevakunivenga.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Migoha yangu yati yivya yidung'u neju kwa ngasi yavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">na upanga wangu yati ukoma vandu vevakunibela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">Yati nikumleka lepi yeyoha mweitovana na nene, hati vevalemili na vakungiwa yati vifwa.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />“Nyenye milima muvalulutila vandu vaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">muni mwene yati ilipisila ngasi ya vatumisi vaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">yati akuvalipisa vamakoko vaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">na kulekekesa mabudilu ga vandu vaki.”<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Vakabwela Musa pamonga na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, vakajova malovi gala muni Vaisilaeli voha vakayuwana.<verse eid="DEU 32:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malovi ga kumalakisa ga Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Musa peamalili kuvajovela vandu va Isilaeli malovi gala goha, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />akavajovela, “Mugavikayi mumitima yinu malovi aga goha genivaluwulili lelu. Muvawula na vana vinu muni vagahengela kwa uchakaka malovi goha ga mihilu iyi ya Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Muni mihilu iyi malovi gawaka lepi nambu mukayidakila mihilu iyi yati mwitama wumi wa magono gamaele pamulima wula wemwihamba kuutola uvya winu, kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Ligono lilolo Bambu Chapanga, akamujovela Musa, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“Kwela kuchitumbi ichi cha Abalimu mbaka chitumbi cha Nebo cha mulima wa Moabu weulolesana na Yeliko, kangi ulola ku Kanaani, mulima wenikuvapela Vaisilaeli uvya wavi. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Kangi yati ufwilila kukoko kuchitumbi ngati muhaja waku Aloni cheafwili kuchitumbi chechikemiwa Holi, <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />Ndava muni nyenye mwavoha mwavavili mwanilangisi lepi usadikika nene palongolo ya Vaisilaeli ku manji ga Meliba, papipi na Kadeshi, kulugangatu lwa Sini, muni mwautopisi lepi nene palongolo ya Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Yati ukuulola mulima wenuwo palongolo yaku cha kutali, nambu yati uyingila lepi mumulima wenuwo wenikuvapela Vaisilaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s">Musa akugamotisa makabila ga Vaisilseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Yeniyi ndi mota yeajovili Musa, mundu wa Chapanga kwa vandu va Isilaeli kwakona kufwa kwaki.<verse eid="DEU 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Akajova, Bambu Chapanga abwelili, kuhumila kuchitumbi Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">atihumalili kuhuma kuchitumbi Seili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">avalangazili vandu kuhuma chitumbi cha Palani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">Abwelili pamonga na mitumi va kunani kwa Chapanga elufu kumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">na motu wewiyaka muchiwoko chaki cha kulyelela.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Bambu Chapanga, avaganili vandu vaki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">na akuvayunga vala vevi vaki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">Voha vifugama pamagendelu paki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">na kupokela malagizu gaki.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Musa atilagisi tiyidakila Malagizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:4">ndi chindu chivaha pamulima witu.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Bambu Chapanga, akavya nkosi wa Vasilaeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">lukumbi vilongosi vavi pevakonganiki na makabila goha pegakonganiki.<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Musa akajova ndava ya likabila la Leubeni:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">“Leubeni atama na akotoka kufwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">na vandu vaki vakoto kuvya vadebe.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Ndava ya likabila la Yuda akajovili:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">“Veve Bambu Chapanga, yuwanila chivembu cha likabila la Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">umuwuyisa kangi kwa vandu vangi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Umkengelela kwa mawoko gaku Bambu Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">na uvatangatila likabila la Yuda pavitovana na makoko vavi.”<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Ndava ya likabila la Lawi akajova:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">“Vee Bambu Chapanga, uvapela vandu va likabila la Lawi uhamula waku wa Ulimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">uhamula waku wa Tumimu kwa vala vevavi vasadikika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">vewavalingili ku Masa.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Valangisi usadikika wavi ukulu kwaku, kuliku kwa vadadi na vanyina vavi na valongo vavi na vana vavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">Vayidaki malagizu gaku kwa usadikika mu lilaganu laku. <verse eid="DEU 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Yati vavawula viveleku vya Yakobo malagizu yaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">vavawula Vaisilaeli malagizu gaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">Valawi vahukisa ubani palongolo yaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">luteta lwoha lwa kutinyisa pandu pa kuwusila luteta paku. <verse eid="DEU 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Veve Bambu Chapanga umotisa makakala;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">Uyidakila mahengu ga mawoko gavi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">Vatova vamakoko vavi voha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">vatova vamakoko vaki hati kuyinuka kavili.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Ndava ya likabila la Benjamini akajova:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">“Lenili ndi likabila lealiganili Bambu Chapanga, na lenilo livya na uteke papipi na mwene.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">Akuvayunga magono gavi goha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">mwene akuvayunga muhi woha na kuvavika chauteke mwene itama pagati yavi.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Ndava ya likabila la Yosefu akajova:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">“Bambu Chapanga na aumotisa mulima waki, kwa mota ya fula na manji kuhuma pandima,<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />umotiswa kwa matunda gabwina gegivya lukumbi lwa chilangasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:14">na kwa matunda ga kila mwehi.<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />Kwa mabenu gabwina ga hitumbi yeyavili kuhumila kadeni,<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Mulima waki umema goha gegavii gabwina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">Chapanga avamotisa kwa vindu vyabwina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">mwene mwajovili kuhuma padasi yayaka motu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">Mota zenizi zivahelelayi vandu va likabila la Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">mweavi mkulu pagati ya valongo vaki.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Ulumba waki ndi ngati ng'ombi yigosi yeyitumbwili kuvelekwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">na mang'elu gaki ndi ngati liyati ligosi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Genago yati ihengela kuvakang'a vandu va milima yingi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Efulaimu yati ivya na mang'elu genago elufu kumi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Mewa Manase yati ivya na mang'elu maelufu.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Kuvala makabila ga Zebuloni na Isakali akajova:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">“Zebuloni hekelelayi mulugendu lwaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">na veve Isakali, hekelelayi mumandanda gaku.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Yati vakuvagongolela vayehe muhitumbi yavi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">na kwenuko vandu yati viwusa teta zeziganikiwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">Ndava muni vene yati vipata vindu vyamahele kuhuma munyanja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">na mewa kuhuma mumusavati wa mumbwani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Kuvala likabila la Gadi akajova:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">“Alumbiwa Chapanga mweampeli Gadi pandu pavaha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Gadi inyemelela ngati lihimba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">ipanyula chiwoko na ludodoso lwa mutu.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Ajihagulili mulima wabwina kuliku milima yingi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Pandu pepahaguliwi ndava ya chilongosi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Avalongwisi vandu kumyidakila Bambu Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">atimilisi mpangu wa Bambu Chapanga kwa Vaisilaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Kuvala likabila la Dani ajovili naha:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">“Dani ndi ngati mwana wa lihimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">lelihumba kuhuma ku Bashani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Kuvala likabila la Nafutali akajova:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">“Veve Nafutali umemili uganisilu wamahele wa Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">Mweumemili mota za Bambu Chapanga, mulima waku ndi kusini ku nyanja ya Galilaya.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Kuvala likabila la Asheli akajova:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">“Amotisiwa Asheli kuliku makabila gangi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">Na aganwa na valongo vaki voha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">na ndima yaki yimema mikongo ya mizeituni.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Vidindilu vya mamilyangu yaku vivya vya lyuma na shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:25">yati utama kwa uteke magono gaku goha.”<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />Musa akamalakisa kwa kujova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">veve Isilaeli avi lepi Chapanga ngati Chapanga waku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">mweibwela kukutangatila kuhuma kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">ipita mumahundi muukulu waki,<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Chapanga wa magono goha ndi mweukumujumbalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">makakala gaki giwonekana pamulima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">Avavingili vamakoko palongolo yinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">akavalagiza: Muvakomekesa.<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Ndava yeniyo, vandu va Isilaeli vakatama chauteke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">vana va Yokobo vene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">mumulima weumemili vyakulya na divayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">mulima weutonyesa fula kwa luumbi lwaki.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Mumotisiwi nyenye Vaisilaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Yani mweavi ngati nyenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">vandu mwemsanguliwi na Bambu Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">mweavii chingwamba cha utangatila winu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">na upanga weukuvakita muvahotola vamakoko vinu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Vamakoko vinu yati vivagaya palongolo yinu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">na nyenye yati mukuvalivatila pahi.<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">Lifwa la Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Kangi, Musa akawuka pamtambu wa Moabu akahamba kuchitumbi cha Nebo, akakwela pachituvilu cha Pisiga chechilolesana na Yeliko, penapo Bambu Chapanga, akamulangisa mulima woho: Kuhuma ku Giliadi mbaka Dani, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />pandu poha pa mulima wa Nafutali na Efulahimu na Manase na Yuda mbaka nyanja ya Meditelenia, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />lugangatu lwa kusini na pandu pa lugangatu lwa likemba la Yeliko, muji wa mitende mbaka ku Soali. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akamujovela Musa, “Wu ndi mulima wula wenavahaidili Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo kuvya yati nikuvapela viveleku vyavi. Nikulangisi uwulola kwa mihu gaku nambu yati uyingila lepi mwenumo.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Hinu Musa mtumisi wa Bambu Chapanga, akafwili kwenuko ku mulima Moabu, ngati cheajovili Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Bambu Chapanga, akamzika mulikemba la Moabu kulolesana na muji wa Beti Peoli, nambu mbaka lelu kawaka mundu mweapamanyili pandu chakaka peazikiwi. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Musa peafwili avii na miyaka miya yimonga na isilini, avii na luhala bwina, akona na makakala, mihu gaki gakoywiki lepi. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Vaisilaeli vatamili kumvembela Musa mulukumbi lwa magono selasini palikemba la mulima wa Moabu, mbaka lukumbi lwa malilu na kumvembela pelwamaliki.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Yoshua mwana wa Nuni amemili mpungu wa luhala ndava Musa amuhagwili kuvya mlanda waki. Ndi Vaisilaeli vakamuyidakila Yoshua vakalanda na malagizu gala Bambu Chapanga, geamupelili Musa.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Kuhumila lukumbi lwenulo mbaka lelu pa Isilaeli ahumalili lepi mlota wa Chapanga ngati Musa mwealongili na Bambu Chapanga mihu kwa mihu. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Kawaka mlota wa Chapanga yungi mweahengili gachinamtiti na gakukangasa ngati Bambu Chapanga geamupelili Musa ahenga kwa nkosi wa Kumisili pamonga na vatangatila vaki na mulima waki woha. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Kawaka mlota wa Chapanga yungi mweahengili mambu gakulu na gakuyogofya ngati cheakitili Musa palongolo ya Vaisilaeli voha.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>